msgid ""
"  codecs web   Web video in Firefox only. Replaces Fedora's empty OpenH264 stand-in with\n"
"               Cisco's OpenH264 from Fedora's Cisco repository, under Cisco's own H.264\n"
"               patent license.\n"
"  codecs full  Everything. Replaces Fedora's free ffmpeg libraries with the full ffmpeg,\n"
"               x264 and x265 from RPM Fusion, the source standard Fedora uses."
msgstr ""
"  codecs web   Spletni video samo v Firefoxu. Fedorin prazni nadomestek za OpenH264 zamenja\n"
"               s Ciscovim OpenH264 iz Fedorinega repozitorija Cisco, pod Ciscovo lastno\n"
"               patentno licenco za H.264.\n"
"  codecs full  Vse. Fedorine proste knjižnice ffmpeg zamenja s polnim ffmpeg ter z x264\n"
"               in x265 iz RPM Fusion, vira, ki ga uporablja standardna Fedora."

msgid ""
"  evenkeel-os-packages install [FILE]   install an .rpm or .deb (no FILE: pick one from Downloads)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages remove           remove an app installed this way\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check FILE       say what a package needs, without installing anything\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages repair           set a broken app box up again (--if-broken: only if one does not work)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages login            choose box apps that start when you log in\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages windows FILE     a Windows .exe or .msi: offer a Linux app that does its job\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check-windows FILE  say what a Windows file is and what would be offered, without any window\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages zoom LINK        a Zoom \"open the app\" link: open the meeting in Zoom's web version, in Chrome\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages vpn [NAME]       add a VPN from its company's own download source (mullvad, proton, ivpn,\n"
"                                        nordvpn; no NAME: pick one)"
msgstr ""
"  evenkeel-os-packages install [FILE]   namesti .rpm ali .deb (brez FILE: izberete ga v mapi Prejemi)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages remove           odstrani aplikacijo, nameščeno na ta način\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check FILE       pove, kaj paket potrebuje, ne da bi kar koli namestil\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages repair           znova nastavi pokvarjen vsebnik za aplikacije (--if-broken: samo če kateri ne deluje)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages login            izbere aplikacije iz vsebnika, ki se zaženejo ob prijavi\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages windows FILE     .exe ali .msi za Windows: ponudi aplikacijo za Linux, ki opravi isto delo\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check-windows FILE  pove, kaj je datoteka za Windows in kaj bi bilo ponujeno, brez okna\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages zoom LINK        povezava Zoom »odpri aplikacijo«: odpre sestanek v spletni različici Zooma v Chromu\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages vpn [NAME]       doda VPN iz lastnega vira za prenos njegovega podjetja (mullvad, proton, ivpn,\n"
"                                        nordvpn; brez NAME: izberete ga)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" comes with Fedora. The trusted list is rebuilt from Fedora's "
"current list at every start, so an update replaces or drops it; keep "
"automatic updates on. If this alert stays after updating and restarting, tell"
" your helper."
msgstr ""
"»{name}« je del Fedore. Seznam zaupanja vrednih potrdil se ob vsakem zagonu "
"znova sestavi iz trenutnega Fedorinega seznama, zato ga posodobitev zamenja "
"ali odstrani; samodejne posodobitve imejte vklopljene. Če to opozorilo ostane"
" tudi po posodobitvi in ponovnem zagonu, obvestite svojega pomočnika."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" has expired, but its file ({file}) holds {n} certificate, and "
"removing it would remove them all, the good ones too. Tell your helper."
msgid_plural ""
"\"{name}\" has expired, but its file ({file}) holds {n} certificates, and "
"removing it would remove them all, the good ones too. Tell your helper."
msgstr[0] ""
"Potrdilo »{name}« je poteklo, vendar njegova datoteka ({file}) vsebuje {n} "
"potrdilo in z njeno odstranitvijo bi odstranili vsa, tudi veljavna. Obvestite"
" svojega pomočnika."
msgstr[1] ""
"Potrdilo »{name}« je poteklo, vendar njegova datoteka ({file}) vsebuje {n} "
"potrdili in z njeno odstranitvijo bi odstranili vsa, tudi veljavna. Obvestite"
" svojega pomočnika."
msgstr[2] ""
"Potrdilo »{name}« je poteklo, vendar njegova datoteka ({file}) vsebuje {n} "
"potrdila in z njeno odstranitvijo bi odstranili vsa, tudi veljavna. Obvestite"
" svojega pomočnika."
msgstr[3] ""
"Potrdilo »{name}« je poteklo, vendar njegova datoteka ({file}) vsebuje {n} "
"potrdil in z njeno odstranitvijo bi odstranili vsa, tudi veljavna. Obvestite "
"svojega pomočnika."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" has expired. It was added in a way Wheelhouse can't remove; tell "
"your helper."
msgstr ""
"Potrdilo »{name}« je poteklo. Dodano je bilo na način, ki ga Wheelhouse ne "
"more odstraniti; obvestite svojega pomočnika."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "\"{name}\" is removed and no longer trusted."
msgstr "Potrdilo »{name}« je odstranjeno in ni več zaupanja vredno."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" was added to this computer and expired on {date}. An expired "
"certificate shouldn't be relied on. Remove it if you no longer need it; if "
"you do, ask whoever gave it to you for a new one. Removing it needs your "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Potrdilo »{name}« je bilo dodano v ta računalnik in je poteklo {date}. Na "
"poteklo potrdilo se ne bi smeli zanašati. Če ga ne potrebujete več, ga "
"odstranite; če ga potrebujete, prosite osebo, ki vam ga je dala, za novega. "
"Za odstranitev potrebujete svoje geslo."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" was added to this computer and expires on {date}. Ask whoever gave"
" it to you for a new one before then."
msgstr ""
"Potrdilo »{name}« je bilo dodano v ta računalnik in poteče {date}. Pred tem "
"prosite osebo, ki vam ga je dala, za novega."

#. Translators: a weekday and date ("Thursday, November 26"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%A, %B %-d"
msgstr "%A, %-d. %B"

#. Translators: a date: month and day ("November 26"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%B %-d"
msgstr "%-d. %B"

#. Translators: a date and a 12-hour time ("November 26, 7:02 PM"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%B %-d, %-I:%M %p"
msgstr "%-d. %B, %-I:%M %p"

#. Translators: a date and a 24-hour time ("November 26, 19:02"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%B %-d, %H:%M"
msgstr "%-d. %B, %H:%M"

msgid "(nothing was printed)"
msgstr "(nič ni bilo izpisano)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "- and {n} more"
msgid_plural "- and {n} more"
msgstr[0] "- in še {n}"
msgstr[1] "- in še {n}"
msgstr[2] "- in še {n}"
msgstr[3] "- in še {n}"

msgid ""
"1.00 is the normal size. Large text in Settings, Accessibility sets 1.25."
msgstr ""
"1,00 je običajna velikost. Možnost »Veliko besedilo« v Nastavitvah, "
"Dostopnost, nastavi 1,25."

msgid "12 hour"
msgstr "12-urni zapis"

msgid "24 hour"
msgstr "24-urni zapis"

msgid ""
"A .deb driver can't be installed. The window says how to get the .rpm from "
"the maker."
msgstr ""
"Gonilnika .deb ni mogoče namestiti. V oknu piše, kako dobiti datoteko .rpm od"
" proizvajalca."

msgid "A USB mouse works."
msgstr "Miška USB deluje."

msgid "A USB webcam works."
msgstr "Spletna kamera USB deluje."

msgid "A VPN"
msgstr "VPN"

msgid "A Windows program you downloaded (.exe or .msi)"
msgstr "Program za Windows, ki ste ga prenesli (.exe ali .msi)"

msgid "A background service fails"
msgstr "Storitev v ozadju ne deluje"

msgid ""
"A background service that runs on this computer fails to start (the mobile "
"broadband service, or the graphics switching service)."
msgstr ""
"Storitev v ozadju, ki se izvaja na tem računalniku, se ne zažene (storitev "
"mobilnega širokopasovnega omrežja ali storitev preklapljanja grafike)."

msgid "A bottom bar, with a start menu on the logo"
msgstr "Spodnja vrstica z začetnim menijem na logotipu"

msgid "A broken app box"
msgstr "Pokvarjen vsebnik za aplikacije"

msgid "A built-in camera of the newer laptop kind was found."
msgstr "Najdena je bila vgrajena kamera, značilna za novejše prenosnike."

msgid "A café, hotel, airport, or anywhere else. Nothing gets in."
msgstr ""
"Kavarna, hotel, letališče ali kjer koli drugje. Nič ne more priti noter."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "A certificate needs attention"
msgid_plural "{n} certificates need attention"
msgstr[0] "{n} potrdilo potrebuje pozornost"
msgstr[1] "{n} potrdili potrebujeta pozornost"
msgstr[2] "{n} potrdila potrebujejo pozornost"
msgstr[3] "{n} potrdil potrebuje pozornost"

msgid ""
"A change to the boot options is waiting. It starts at your next restart. It isn't an update.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't want it: Don't use it. The computer starts with the boot options it has now, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Or Keep it."
msgstr ""
"Čaka sprememba možnosti zagona. Uveljavi se ob naslednjem ponovnem zagonu. To ni posodobitev.\n"
"\n"
"Če je ne želite: Ne uporabi. Računalnik se zažene z možnostmi zagona, ki jih ima zdaj, samodejne posodobitve pa niso začasno ustavljene.\n"
"\n"
"Ali pa Obdrži."

msgid "A device"
msgstr "Naprava"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "A device lost its driver ({driver})"
msgstr "Naprava je izgubila gonilnik ({driver})"

msgid "A disk is hidden."
msgstr "Disk je skrit."

msgid "A driver file from the maker"
msgstr "Datoteka gonilnika od proizvajalca"

msgid "A file of recent errors to email to your helper"
msgstr ""
"Datoteka z nedavnimi napakami, ki jo lahko po e-pošti pošljete svojemu "
"pomočniku"

msgid "A full name can't have : or , in it."
msgstr "Polno ime ne sme vsebovati znakov : ali ,."

msgid "A graphics chip has no driver."
msgstr "Grafični čip nima gonilnika."

msgid ""
"A network is only needed for automatic time and time zone. To use Wi-Fi, "
"click a network. Or click Next to go on without it."
msgstr ""
"Omrežje je potrebno samo za samodejno nastavitev časa in časovnega pasu. Če "
"želite uporabljati Wi-Fi, kliknite omrežje. Ali pa kliknite »Naprej«, da "
"nadaljujete brez tega."

msgid ""
"A new layout shows after you log out and back in. It changes only your own "
"desktop."
msgstr ""
"Nova postavitev se prikaže, ko se odjavite in nato znova prijavite. Spremeni "
"samo vaše namizje."

msgid "A new system is ready."
msgstr "Nov sistem je pripravljen."

msgid "A new system is ready. Restart to use it."
msgstr "Nov sistem je pripravljen. Za uporabo znova zaženite računalnik."

msgid ""
"A new system version is used from the next restart. Keep working, and restart"
" when it suits you."
msgstr ""
"Ob naslednjem ponovnem zagonu bo uporabljena nova različica sistema. "
"Nadaljujte z delom in znova zaženite, ko vam ustreza."

msgid ""
"A new version also goes back if something that worked before is broken after "
"you log in, like sound, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, the camera or printing. Unplugged "
"or switched-off things don't count."
msgstr ""
"Sistem se prav tako vrne na prejšnjo različico, če po prijavi ne deluje več "
"nekaj, kar je prej delovalo – na primer zvok, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, kamera ali "
"tiskanje. Odklopljene ali izklopljene naprave se ne upoštevajo."

msgid "A new version is ready"
msgstr "Nova različica je pripravljena"

msgid ""
"A note at the next login says so and names what broke, and automatic updates "
"pause for 3 days."
msgstr ""
"Ob naslednji prijavi se prikaže opomba, ki to sporoča in navede, kaj je "
"prenehalo delovati, samodejne posodobitve pa se za 3 dni začasno ustavijo."

msgid ""
"A rollback test copy is running. Restart first, so the computer goes back to "
"the usual version."
msgstr ""
"V teku je testna kopija za samodejno vrnitev. Najprej znova zaženite "
"računalnik, da se vrne na običajno različico."

msgid "A security certificate expired, expires within 30 days, or was removed."
msgstr ""
"Varnostno potrdilo je poteklo, poteče v 30 dneh ali pa je bilo odstranjeno."

msgid "A slideshow of your own pictures"
msgstr "Diaprojekcija vaših lastnih slik"

msgid "A sound chip was found, but it didn't start."
msgstr "Zvočni čip je bil najden, vendar se ni zagnal."

msgid "A start-up check fails"
msgstr "Preverjanje ob zagonu ni uspelo"

msgid ""
"A start-up check fails on purpose. The computer restarts by itself within "
"seconds, twice, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Preverjanje ob zagonu namerno ne uspe. Računalnik se v nekaj sekundah "
"samodejno dvakrat znova zažene, ob tretjem zagonu pa se vrne na to različico."

msgid "A system service fails"
msgstr "Sistemska storitev ne deluje"

msgid "A system update is also waiting for a restart."
msgstr "Tudi posodobitev sistema čaka na ponovni zagon."

msgid "A tool"
msgstr "Orodje"

msgid "A top bar, with the logo menu at the top left"
msgstr "Zgornja vrstica z menijem z logotipom v zgornjem levem kotu"

msgid ""
"A user name uses small letters, digits, - and _, and starts with a letter."
msgstr ""
"Uporabniško ime uporablja male črke, številke, - in _, ter se začne s črko."

msgid ""
"A wired network is set to Home, so this happens on any cable you plug in."
msgstr ""
"Žično omrežje je nastavljeno na Dom, zato to velja za vsak kabel, ki ga "
"priključite."

msgid "A wireless chip was found, but it didn't start."
msgstr "Najden je bil brezžični čip, vendar se ni zagnal."

msgid "A wireless chip was found, with no driver for it."
msgstr "Najden je bil brezžični čip, zanj pa ni gonilnika."

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off Panel Replay"
msgstr "AMD: utripanje, izklopi Panel Replay"

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off Panel Self Refresh"
msgstr "AMD: utripanje, izklopi Panel Self Refresh"

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off both"
msgstr "AMD: utripanje, izklopi oboje"

msgid "AMD: screen dims or shifts colors on its own"
msgstr "AMD: zaslon samodejno potemni ali spremeni barve"

msgid "AMD: white flickering"
msgstr "AMD: belo utripanje"

msgid ""
"About 20 seconds after the login screen shows, the computer locks up. Hold "
"the power button until it turns off, then turn it on. After the second "
"freeze, the next start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Približno 20 sekund po prikazu prijavnega zaslona računalnik zamrzne. Držite "
"gumb za vklop, dokler se ne izklopi, nato ga vklopite. Po drugi zamrznitvi se"
" računalnik ob naslednjem zagonu vrne na to različico."

msgid "About it"
msgstr "O tem"

msgid "About this driver"
msgstr "O tem gonilniku"

msgid "Accent color and wallpaper"
msgstr "Barva poudarka in ozadje"

msgid "Account"
msgstr "Račun"

msgid "Add"
msgstr "Dodaj"

msgid "Add a folder"
msgstr "Dodaj mapo"

msgid "Add a folder and set the sharing password below."
msgstr "Dodajte mapo in spodaj nastavite geslo za skupno rabo."

msgid "Add a folder from your home folder."
msgstr "Dodajte mapo iz svoje domače mape."

msgid "Add a printer"
msgstr "Dodaj tiskalnik"

msgid "Add a setting, like amdgpu.abmlevel=0"
msgstr "Dodajte nastavitev, na primer amdgpu.abmlevel=0"

msgid "Add anyway"
msgstr "Vseeno dodaj"

msgid "Add it"
msgstr "Dodaj"

msgid ""
"Add it only if you know you need it. If the computer then won't start, "
"automatic rollback goes back to the version before."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte jo le, če veste, da jo potrebujete. Če se računalnik nato ne zažene, "
"ga samodejna vrnitev vrne na prejšnjo različico."

msgid "Add or remove an app's hardware rules"
msgstr "Dodaj ali odstrani pravila za strojno opremo aplikacije"

msgid "Add or remove media codecs"
msgstr "Dodaj ali odstrani kodeke za predstavnost"

msgid "Add the media codecs"
msgstr "Dodaj kodeke za predstavnost"

msgid "Add to the system"
msgstr "Dodaj v sistem"

msgid "Add video and audio codecs"
msgstr "Dodaj video in avdio kodeke"

msgid "Add, turn on or remove a VPN or an app's background service"
msgstr ""
"Dodaj, vklopi ali odstrani VPN ali storitev aplikacije, ki deluje v ozadju"

msgid "Added by you"
msgstr "Dodali ste vi"

msgid "Added to this computer"
msgstr "Dodano v ta računalnik"

msgid "Adding a printer, and printer driver files from the maker"
msgstr "Dodajanje tiskalnika in datotek gonilnikov tiskalnika od proizvajalca"

msgid ""
"Adding the desktop parts apps expect (progress windows and notifications)"
msgstr ""
"Dodajanje elementov namizja, ki jih aplikacije pričakujejo (okna z napredkom "
"in obvestila)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding the download source {name}"
msgstr "Dodajanje vira za prenos {name}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system"
msgstr "Dodajanje {title} v sistem"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system from Fedora. A progress window shows it."
msgstr ""
"Dodajanje {title} v sistem iz Fedore. Potek je prikazan v oknu z napredkom."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system from Fedora. This can take a few minutes."
msgstr "Dodajanje {title} v sistem iz Fedore. To lahko traja nekaj minut."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system. A progress window shows it."
msgstr "Dodajanje {title} v sistem. Potek je prikazan v oknu z napredkom."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system. This can take a few minutes."
msgstr "Dodajanje {title} v sistem. To lahko traja nekaj minut."

msgid "Administrator"
msgstr "Skrbnik"

msgid "Administrator account (root)"
msgstr "Skrbniški račun (root)"

msgid "Administrator: no."
msgstr "Skrbnik: ne."

msgid "Administrator: yes."
msgstr "Skrbnik: da."

msgid ""
"After a BIOS update, it may ask for the disk password again. Turn it on again"
" here."
msgstr ""
"Po posodobitvi BIOS-a bo morda znova zahteval geslo za disk. Tukaj ga znova "
"vklopite."

msgid ""
"After an undo, so the same update doesn't come straight back. They turn back "
"on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Po razveljavitvi, da se ista posodobitev ne vrne takoj nazaj. Same se ponovno"
" vklopijo."

msgid "After the restart, you will be asked to add your printer."
msgstr "Po ponovnem zagonu boste pozvani, da dodate svoj tiskalnik."

msgid ""
"After the restart, you'll be asked for your password once, to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Po ponovnem zagonu boste enkrat morali vnesti geslo, da funkcijo vklopite."

msgid "After the restart, you'll get a message when it's ready."
msgstr "Po ponovnem zagonu boste prejeli sporočilo, ko bo vse pripravljeno."

msgid "Alpha"
msgstr "Alfa"

msgid "Also let in, on Home"
msgstr "Dovoli tudi v omrežju »Dom«"

msgid ""
"Alt+Tab switches between apps. Alt and the key above Tab switches between "
"windows of the same app."
msgstr ""
"Alt+Tab preklaplja med aplikacijami. Alt in tipka nad tipko Tab preklapljata "
"med okni iste aplikacije."

msgid ""
"An .rpm or .deb installs the app. An .exe or .msi gets its Linux version."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka .rpm ali .deb namesti aplikacijo. Za datoteko .exe ali .msi dobite "
"njeno različico za Linux."

msgid "An app that comes as a .rpm or .deb file"
msgstr "Aplikacija, ki je na voljo kot datoteka .rpm ali .deb"

msgid "An office. Nothing gets in, and your folders aren't shared."
msgstr "Pisarna. Nič ne more priti noter in vaše mape niso v skupni rabi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An update from {staged} is waiting. It starts at your next restart. The version you're using now is from {booted}.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't want it: Don't use it. Your computer keeps the version it has now. A boot options change made since the update came is dropped with it."
msgstr ""
"Čaka posodobitev iz {staged}. Uveljavi se ob naslednjem ponovnem zagonu. Različica, ki jo uporabljate zdaj, je iz {booted}.\n"
"\n"
"Če je ne želite: Ne uporabi. Računalnik obdrži različico, ki jo ima zdaj. Sprememba možnosti zagona, narejena po prihodu posodobitve, bo zavržena skupaj z njo."

msgid "An update is waiting for a restart. Restart first, then run the test."
msgstr ""
"Posodobitev čaka na ponovni zagon. Najprej znova zaženite računalnik, nato "
"zaženite preizkus."

msgid "Another disk is hidden by a BIOS setting."
msgstr "Drug disk je skrit zaradi nastavitve BIOS-a."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Another install or removal is running ({doing}). This waits for it to finish,"
" then goes on."
msgstr ""
"Poteka druga namestitev ali odstranitev ({doing}). Ta postopek počaka, da se "
"konča, nato nadaljuje."

msgid ""
"Another version is set to start at your next restart (after Undo the last "
"update, or picking a version in the boot menu), so the test wouldn't test "
"anything. Restart first, then run the test."
msgstr ""
"Ob naslednjem ponovnem zagonu se bo zagnala druga različica (po »Razveljavi "
"zadnjo posodobitev« ali izbiri različice v zagonskem meniju), zato preizkus "
"ne bi ničesar preizkusil. Najprej znova zaženite računalnik, nato zaženite "
"preizkus."

msgid "App"
msgstr "Aplikacija"

msgid "App, game or port number"
msgstr "Aplikacija, igra ali številka vrat"

msgid ""
"Applies them at login: the next slide for \"at each login\", and dark or "
"light for the time of day"
msgstr ""
"Uporabi jih ob prijavi: naslednjo sliko za »Ob vsaki prijavi« ter temno ali "
"svetlo glede na čas dneva"

msgid "Apps"
msgstr "Aplikacije"

msgid "Apps and ports let in"
msgstr "Dovoljene aplikacije in vrata"

msgid "Apps from Bazaar have this setting inside the app."
msgstr "Aplikacije iz Bazaarja imajo to nastavitev znotraj aplikacije."

msgid "Apps from Bazaar update on their own. Remove them in Bazaar too."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacije iz Bazaarja se posodabljajo samodejno. Odstranite jih tudi v "
"Bazaarju."

msgid "Apps from Bazaar: open Bazaar and remove it there."
msgstr "Aplikacije iz Bazaarja: odprite Bazaar in jo odstranite tam."

msgid ""
"Apps from a file, Get a VPN or a Windows program: Wheelhouse, Apps, Remove "
"apps."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacije iz datoteke, iz »Pridobi VPN« ali programi za Windows: Wheelhouse,"
" Aplikacije, Odstrani aplikacije."

msgid ""
"Apps from a file: open Wheelhouse, Apps, Start apps at login, and pick the "
"app. Picking it again stops it."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacije iz datoteke: odprite Wheelhouse, Aplikacije, Zaženi aplikacije ob "
"prijavi in izberite aplikacijo. Če jo izberete znova, se ne zažene več."

msgid "Apps from package files"
msgstr "Aplikacije iz paketnih datotek"

msgid "Apps from their own download sources"
msgstr "Aplikacije iz njihovih lastnih virov za prenos"

msgid "Apps you added from files, Get a VPN or Windows programs"
msgstr ""
"Aplikacije, ki ste jih dodali iz datotek, iz »Pridobi VPN« ali iz programov "
"za Windows"

msgid "April"
msgstr "april"

msgid ""
"ArtCraft's downloads can't be reached right now. Check the internet "
"connection and try again."
msgstr ""
"Trenutno ni mogoče dostopati do prenosov ArtCrafta. Preverite internetno "
"povezavo in poskusite znova."

msgid "ArtCraft's signature is checked first, and it updates once a day."
msgstr "Najprej se preveri podpis ArtCrafta, posodablja pa se enkrat na dan."

msgid ""
"Asks once whether a password Wi-Fi or wired network is Home, Work or a Public"
" place"
msgstr ""
"Enkrat vpraša, ali je omrežje Wi-Fi z geslom ali žično omrežje Dom, Služba "
"ali Javni prostor"

msgid "At each login"
msgstr "Ob vsaki prijavi"

msgid "August"
msgstr "avgust"

msgid "Authentication is required to add or remove an app's hardware rules"
msgstr ""
"Za dodajanje ali odstranjevanje pravil za strojno opremo aplikacije je "
"potrebna avtentikacija"

msgid "Authentication is required to add or remove media codecs"
msgstr ""
"Za dodajanje ali odstranjevanje kodekov za predstavnost je potrebna "
"avtentikacija"

msgid ""
"Authentication is required to add, turn on or remove a VPN or an app's "
"background service"
msgstr ""
"Za dodajanje, vklop ali odstranitev VPN-ja oziroma storitve aplikacije, ki "
"deluje v ozadju, je potrebna avtentikacija"

msgid "Authentication is required to change a Wheelhouse setting"
msgstr "Za spremembo nastavitve Wheelhouse je potrebna avtentikacija"

msgid "Authentication is required to change the boot options"
msgstr "Za spremembo možnosti zagona je potrebna avtentikacija"

msgid ""
"Authentication is required to delete important settings for the repair test"
msgstr ""
"Za izbris pomembnih nastavitev za preizkus popravila je potrebna "
"avtentikacija"

msgid "Authentication is required to install EvenKeelOS"
msgstr "Za namestitev EvenKeelOS je potrebna avtentikacija"

msgid "Authentication is required to remove a trusted certificate"
msgstr "Za odstranitev zaupanja vrednega potrdila je potrebna avtentikacija"

msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Samodejno"

msgid "Automatic disk unlock"
msgstr "Samodejno odklepanje diska"

msgid "Automatic rollback"
msgstr "Samodejna vrnitev na prejšnje stanje"

msgid "Automatic rollback note"
msgstr "Opomba o samodejni vrnitvi na prejšnje stanje"

msgid "Automatic updates"
msgstr "Samodejne posodobitve"

msgid "Automatic updates are back on."
msgstr "Samodejne posodobitve so spet vklopljene."

msgid "Automatic updates are back on. The next daily update runs as normal."
msgstr ""
"Samodejne posodobitve so spet vklopljene. Naslednja dnevna posodobitev bo "
"potekala kot običajno."

msgid "Automatic updates are off"
msgstr "Samodejne posodobitve so izklopljene"

msgid "Automatic updates are off. Run System Update yourself to update."
msgstr ""
"Samodejne posodobitve so izklopljene. Za posodobitev sami zaženite "
"»Posodobitev sistema«."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates are off: nothing updates until you run System Update yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Turn on. Everything then updates by itself every day at 4 am, and updates fix security problems."
msgstr ""
"Samodejne posodobitve so izklopljene: nič se ne posodobi, dokler sami ne zaženete »Posodobitev sistema«.\n"
"\n"
"Priporočeno: Vklopi. Nato se vse samodejno posodobi vsak dan ob 4. uri zjutraj, posodobitve pa odpravljajo varnostne težave."

msgid "Automatic updates are on."
msgstr "Samodejne posodobitve so vklopljene."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates are on: everything updates by itself every day at 4 am.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Keep them on. Updates fix security problems.\n"
"\n"
"Or Turn off: nothing updates until you run System Update yourself."
msgstr ""
"Samodejne posodobitve so vklopljene: vse se samodejno posodobi vsak dan ob 4. uri zjutraj.\n"
"\n"
"Priporočeno: Pusti jih vklopljene. Posodobitve odpravljajo varnostne težave.\n"
"\n"
"Ali pa Izklopi: nič se ne posodobi, dokler sami ne zaženete »Posodobitev sistema«."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Automatic updates are paused until {day}"
msgstr "Samodejne posodobitve so začasno ustavljene do {day}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Automatic updates are paused until {day}, after an undo, so the bad update doesn't come back. They turn back on by themselves.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Keep the pause.\n"
"\n"
"Or Resume now: the next daily update runs as normal. Or Turn off: nothing updates until you run System Update yourself."
msgstr ""
"Samodejne posodobitve so po razveljavitvi začasno ustavljene do {day}, da se slaba posodobitev ne vrne. Same se znova vklopijo.\n"
"\n"
"Priporočeno: Obdrži premor.\n"
"\n"
"Ali pa Nadaljuj zdaj: naslednja dnevna posodobitev poteka kot običajno. Ali pa Izklopi: nič se ne posodobi, dokler sami ne zaženete »Posodobitev sistema«."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Automatic updates are paused until {day}, so the bad update doesn't come "
"back. They turn back on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Samodejne posodobitve so začasno ustavljene do {day}, da se slaba posodobitev"
" ne vrne. Same se ponovno vklopijo."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Automatic updates are paused until {day}, so the same update doesn't come "
"straight back. They turn back on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Samodejne posodobitve so začasno ustavljene do {day}, da se ista posodobitev "
"ne namesti takoj znova. Same se ponovno vklopijo."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates are still paused after the undo. Resume them in Automatic "
"updates."
msgstr ""
"Samodejne posodobitve so po razveljavitvi še vedno začasno ustavljene. "
"Nadaljujte jih v razdelku Samodejne posodobitve."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates could not be paused, so the next one may bring the update "
"back. If it does, turn off Automatic updates in Wheelhouse and tell your "
"helper."
msgstr ""
"Samodejnih posodobitev ni bilo mogoče začasno ustaviti, zato lahko naslednja "
"posodobitev znova namesti to posodobitev. Če se to zgodi, izklopite samodejne"
" posodobitve v Wheelhouse in obvestite svojega pomočnika."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates pause for 3 days, so the same update doesn't come straight "
"back. They turn back on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Samodejne posodobitve se začasno ustavijo za 3 dni, da se ista posodobitev ne"
" vrne takoj. Same se ponovno vklopijo."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates then pause for 3 days, so the bad update doesn't come "
"straight back. If the problem returns after that, turn off Automatic updates "
"in Wheelhouse and tell your helper."
msgstr ""
"Samodejne posodobitve se nato za 3 dni ustavijo, da se slaba posodobitev ne "
"vrne takoj. Če se težava po tem znova pojavi, izklopite samodejne posodobitve"
" v Wheelhouse in obvestite svojega pomočnika."

msgid "Automatic updates, undoing an update, firmware and certificate alerts"
msgstr ""
"Samodejne posodobitve, razveljavitev posodobitve, opozorila o vdelani "
"programski opremi in potrdilih"

msgid ""
"Away from home, the switch shows off: sharing only runs on a Home network, "
"and comes back by itself there."
msgstr ""
"Ko niste doma, stikalo kaže izklopljeno: skupna raba deluje samo v omrežju "
"»Dom« in se tam samodejno znova vklopi."

msgid "BIOS settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve BIOS-a"

msgid "Back"
msgstr "Nazaj"

msgid "Back to the original"
msgstr "Nazaj na izvirno"

msgid "Background: click a picture. To use your own photo, click Add Picture."
msgstr ""
"Ozadje: kliknite sliko. Če želite uporabiti svojo fotografijo, kliknite Dodaj"
" sliko."

msgid "Basic graphics only"
msgstr "Samo osnovna grafika"

msgid "Battery status"
msgstr "Stanje baterije"

msgid "Bazaar is open. Close it when you're done looking."
msgstr "Bazaar je odprt. Ko končate z ogledovanjem, ga zaprite."

msgid "Bazaar, the app store (Flathub)"
msgstr "Bazaar, trgovina z aplikacijami (Flathub)"

msgid ""
"Before you unplug it, click the eject button next to its name, and wait until"
" it's gone from the list."
msgstr ""
"Preden napravo odklopite, kliknite gumb za izmet poleg njenega imena in "
"počakajte, da izgine s seznama."

msgid "Bluetooth"
msgstr "Bluetooth"

msgid "Bluetooth driver blocked"
msgstr "Gonilnik za Bluetooth je blokiran"

msgid "Bluetooth found."
msgstr "Najden je Bluetooth."

msgid "Boot entries that will be renamed to \"%s\":"
msgstr "Zagonski vnosi, ki bodo preimenovani v »%s«:"

msgid "Boot options"
msgstr "Možnosti zagona"

msgid "Boot options in Wheelhouse can change them back later."
msgstr ""
"Z orodjem »Možnosti zagona« v Wheelhouse jih lahko pozneje spremenite nazaj."

msgid "Both"
msgstr "Oboje"

msgid "Both ask for your password, and work only on Home."
msgstr "Obe zahtevata vaše geslo in delujeta samo v omrežju »Dom«."

msgid "Bottom bar and a start menu"
msgstr "Spodnja vrstica in začetni meni"

msgid "Box"
msgstr "Vsebnik"

msgid "Broadcom Wi-Fi chip found. Its driver or firmware can't be included."
msgstr ""
"Najden je čip Wi-Fi Broadcom. Njegovega gonilnika ali vdelane programske "
"opreme ni mogoče vključiti."

msgid "Browse and install apps in Bazaar. They update on their own."
msgstr ""
"Prebrskajte in namestite aplikacije v Bazaarju. Posodabljajo se samodejno."

msgid "Camera"
msgstr "Kamera"

msgid "Camera found."
msgstr "Najdena je kamera."

msgid "Can install software and change system settings. Click to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"Lahko namesti programsko opremo in spremeni sistemske nastavitve. Kliknite za"
" izklop."

msgid "Can install software and change system settings. Click to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Lahko namesti programsko opremo in spremeni sistemske nastavitve. Kliknite za"
" vklop."

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Prekliči"

msgid "Certificate"
msgstr "Potrdilo"

msgid "Certificate alert"
msgstr "Opozorilo o potrdilu"

msgid "Certificate alerts"
msgstr "Opozorila o potrdilih"

msgid ""
"Certificates are how the computer knows a secure website is real. An alert "
"shows when one has expired, expires soon, or was removed."
msgstr ""
"Potrdila so način, kako računalnik ve, da je varno spletišče resnično. "
"Opozorilo se prikaže, ko je potrdilo poteklo, kmalu poteče ali je bilo "
"odstranjeno."

msgid "Change"
msgstr "Spremeni"

msgid "Change Scale. A bigger number makes everything bigger."
msgstr "Spremenite »Prilagodi velikost«. Večja številka vse poveča."

msgid "Change a Wheelhouse setting"
msgstr "Spremeni nastavitev Wheelhouse"

msgid "Change it"
msgstr "Zamenjaj"

msgid "Change the kernel settings the computer starts with"
msgstr "Spremeni nastavitve jedra, s katerimi se računalnik zažene"

msgid "Change the layout"
msgstr "Spremeni postavitev"

msgid "Change the wallpaper to the next picture in a folder"
msgstr "Zamenjaj ozadje z naslednjo sliko v mapi"

msgid ""
"Changed your mind? Open Undo the last update again and click Use the newer "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Ste si premislili? Znova odprite »Razveljavi zadnjo posodobitev« in kliknite "
"»Uporabi novejšo različico«."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Changing {title}"
msgstr "Spreminjanje {title}"

msgid ""
"Check everything. Click a line to change it, or click Install to put "
"EvenKeelOS on the disk."
msgstr ""
"Preverite vse. Kliknite vrstico, če jo želite spremeniti, ali pa kliknite "
"»Namesti«, da EvenKeelOS namestite na disk."

msgid "Check that automatic rollback works"
msgstr "Preveri, ali samodejna vrnitev na prejšnje stanje deluje"

msgid "Check that it can't break"
msgstr "Preveri, da se ne more pokvariti"

msgid ""
"Check that the computer goes back by itself when a new version won't start, "
"and puts back deleted settings"
msgstr ""
"Preverite, ali se računalnik samodejno vrne na prejšnjo različico, ko se nova"
" različica ne zažene, in ali obnovi izbrisane nastavitve"

msgid "Check the BIOS's storage settings."
msgstr "Preverite nastavitve shranjevanja v BIOS-u."

msgid "Check the boxes"
msgstr "Preveri vsebnike"

msgid "Checked against its own docs"
msgstr "Preverjeno glede na lastno dokumentacijo"

msgid "Checked every day too"
msgstr "Preverjeno tudi vsak dan"

msgid "Checking for firmware updates."
msgstr "Preverjanje posodobitev vdelane programske opreme."

msgid "Checking sharing…"
msgstr "Preverjanje skupne rabe …"

msgid "Checking the network…"
msgstr "Preverjanje omrežja …"

msgid "Checking this computer's parts..."
msgstr "Preverjanje delov tega računalnika ..."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Checking whether Fedora has {name}."
msgstr "Preverjanje, ali ima Fedora {name}."

msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "Preverjanje …"

msgid "Choose"
msgstr "Izberi"

msgid "Choose apps from .rpm or .deb files that start when you log in"
msgstr ""
"Izberite aplikacije iz datotek .rpm ali .deb, ki se zaženejo ob prijavi"

msgid "Choose which app opens a file"
msgstr "Izberite, katera aplikacija naj odpre datoteko"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Chosen: automatic, from {servers}."
msgstr "Izbrano: samodejno, vir: {servers}."

msgid "Chosen: don't encrypt."
msgstr "Izbrano: ne šifriraj."

msgid "Chosen: enabled."
msgstr "Izbrano: omogočeno."

msgid "Chosen: encrypt."
msgstr "Izbrano: šifriraj."

msgid "Chosen: locked."
msgstr "Izbrano: zaklenjeno."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Chosen: {disk}."
msgstr "Izbrano: {disk}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Chosen: {names}."
msgstr "Izbrano: {names}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Chosen: {name}."
msgstr "Izbrano: {name}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Chosen: {time}."
msgstr "Izbrano: {time}."

msgid ""
"Click Add a folder and pick it. It starts as Read only: change it to Read and"
" write if the other computer should save there too."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite »Dodaj mapo« in jo izberite. Sprva je nastavljena na »Samo za "
"branje«: spremenite jo na »Branje in pisanje«, če naj tudi drugi računalnik "
"tam shranjuje."

msgid "Click Apply, then Keep Changes if it looks right."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite »Uveljavi«, nato pa »Ohrani spremembe«, če je vse videti prav."

msgid "Click Back to the original to undo all of it."
msgstr "Kliknite »Nazaj na izvirno«, da razveljavite vse."

msgid ""
"Click Free up disk space, then Free up space. Your files and apps aren't "
"touched."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite »Sprosti prostor na disku«, nato pa še »Sprosti prostor«. Vaših "
"datotek in aplikacij se to ne dotakne."

msgid ""
"Click Install the driver, type your password, and restart. Then add the "
"printer."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite »Namesti gonilnik«, vnesite geslo in znova zaženite računalnik. Nato"
" dodajte tiskalnik."

msgid "Click Install, and it installs that instead."
msgstr "Kliknite »Namesti« in namesto tega se namesti to."

msgid ""
"Click Let an app in, type its name, like Minecraft or Jellyfin, and click it."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite »Dovoli dostop aplikaciji«, vnesite njeno ime, na primer Minecraft "
"ali Jellyfin, in jo kliknite."

msgid ""
"Click Restart to start EvenKeelOS. Click Save the log to put the details of "
"this install on a second USB stick."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite »Znova zaženi«, da zaženete EvenKeelOS. Kliknite »Shrani dnevnik«, "
"da shranite podrobnosti te namestitve na drugi USB ključ."

msgid ""
"Click Save details. It makes one file of recent errors, in Documents. Nothing"
" is sent anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite »Shrani podrobnosti«. Tako bo v mapi »Dokumenti« ustvarjena ena "
"datoteka z nedavnimi napakami. Nič se ne pošlje nikamor."

msgid "Click Show the file, then attach it to an email to your helper."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite »Prikaži datoteko«, nato pa jo priložite e-poštnemu sporočilu, ki ga"
" pošljete svojemu pomočniku."

msgid "Click Test to hear each speaker."
msgstr "Kliknite »Preizkus«, da slišite vsak zvočnik."

msgid "Click Turn off or Turn on. Turning them off asks for your password."
msgstr "Kliknite »Izklopi« ali »Vklopi«. Za izklop boste morali vnesti geslo."

msgid "Click Turn on, type the disk password once, and restart."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite »Vklopi«, enkrat vnesite geslo za disk in znova zaženite računalnik."

msgid ""
"Click Undo the update, type your password, and restart. Your files and apps "
"aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite »Razveljavi posodobitev«, vnesite geslo in znova zaženite "
"računalnik. Vaših datotek in aplikacij se to ne dotakne."

msgid ""
"Click a font to pick another, or change Text size. 1.00 is the normal size."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite pisavo, da izberete drugo, ali spremenite »Velikost besedila«. 1,00 "
"je običajna velikost."

msgid "Click the USB stick to save them on."
msgstr "Kliknite USB ključ, da jih shranite nanj."

msgid ""
"Click the clock to see your notifications and the calendar. Or press Windows "
"key + V."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite uro, da si ogledate obvestila in koledar. Ali pa pritisnite tipko "
"Windows + V."

msgid "Click the copy button next to a command, then paste it in Terminal."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite gumb za kopiranje poleg ukaza, nato pa ga prilepite v Terminal."

msgid "Click the device's name when it shows in the list."
msgstr "Kliknite ime naprave, ko se prikaže na seznamu."

msgid ""
"Click the icons at the end of the bar, then the arrow next to Wi-Fi. Or open "
"Settings, Wi-Fi."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ikone na koncu vrstice, nato pa puščico poleg »Omrežje Wi-Fi«. Ali "
"pa odprite Nastavitve, Omrežje Wi-Fi."

msgid ""
"Click the icons at the end of the bar: the bottom right with the Windows-"
"style layout, the top right with the standard one. Or press Windows key + S."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ikone na koncu vrstice: spodaj desno pri postavitvi v slogu sistema "
"Windows, zgoraj desno pri standardni postavitvi. Ali pa pritisnite tipko "
"Windows + S."

msgid ""
"Click the magnifying glass, or press Ctrl+F, and type to search this folder "
"and the folders in it."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ikono povečevalnega stekla ali pritisnite Ctrl+F in vnesite iskalni "
"niz, da poiščete v tej mapi in v podmapah v njej."

msgid "Click the meeting link you were sent."
msgstr "Kliknite povezavo do sestanka, ki ste jo prejeli."

msgid "Click the network's name, type its password, and press Enter."
msgstr "Kliknite ime omrežja, vnesite njegovo geslo in pritisnite Enter."

msgid ""
"Click the printer when it shows, then Add. Most printers need nothing else."
msgstr ""
"Ko se tiskalnik prikaže, ga kliknite, nato kliknite »Dodaj«. Večina "
"tiskalnikov ne potrebuje ničesar drugega."

msgid "Clock"
msgstr "Ura"

msgid "Clock sync"
msgstr "Sinhronizacija ure"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Zapri"

msgid "Close it again"
msgstr "Ponovno zapri"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Close {name} again"
msgstr "Ponovno zapri {name}"

msgid "Code and terminal"
msgstr "Koda in terminal"

msgid "Collecting the problem details."
msgstr "Zbiranje podrobnosti o težavi."

msgid "Colors and wallpaper"
msgstr "Barve in ozadje"

msgid "Comes with the system"
msgstr "Priloženo sistemu"

msgid "Coming from Windows"
msgstr "Prehod s sistema Windows"

msgid "Coming from Windows: where things are, and what's different"
msgstr "Prehod s sistema Windows: kje so stvari in kaj je drugače"

msgid "Coming from Windows?"
msgstr "Prihajate iz sistema Windows?"

msgid "Common fixes"
msgstr "Pogoste rešitve"

msgid "Computer name"
msgstr "Ime računalnika"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Computer name: {name}."
msgstr "Ime računalnika: {name}."

msgid "Connect"
msgstr "Poveži"

msgid "Connect a Bluetooth device"
msgstr "Poveži napravo Bluetooth"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Connected to {network}."
msgstr "Povezano z {network}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Connecting to {network}..."
msgstr "Povezovanje z {network} …"

msgid ""
"Control Panel: Settings, for Wi-Fi, screens, sound, printers and accounts. "
"Wheelhouse, for updates, apps and fixes. A ship is steered from its "
"wheelhouse; this is where you steer your computer."
msgstr ""
"Nadzorna plošča: Nastavitve, za Wi-Fi, zaslone, zvok, tiskalnike in račune. "
"Wheelhouse, za posodobitve, aplikacije in popravke. Ladjo krmilijo iz "
"krmarnice (angl. wheelhouse); tukaj krmilite svoj računalnik."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Copied: {command}"
msgstr "Kopirano: {command}"

msgid "Copy files by dragging them onto it, or with Ctrl+C and Ctrl+V."
msgstr "Datoteke kopirate tako, da jih povlečete nanj, ali s Ctrl+C in Ctrl+V."

msgid "Copy the command"
msgstr "Kopiraj ukaz"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Copy {command}"
msgstr "Kopiraj {command}"

msgid "Copying EvenKeelOS to the disk"
msgstr "Kopiranje EvenKeelOS na disk"

msgid "Copying EvenKeelOS to the disk failed."
msgstr "Kopiranje EvenKeelOS na disk ni uspelo."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Could not connect to {network}. Check the password."
msgstr "Povezave z {network} ni bilo mogoče vzpostaviti. Preverite geslo."

msgid ""
"Couldn't check for firmware updates. Check your internet connection and try "
"again."
