"If something stopped working after an update, open Wheelhouse, Updates, Undo "
"the last update."
msgstr ""
"Če je po posodobitvi nekaj prenehalo delovati, odprite Wheelhouse, "
"Posodobitve, Razveljavi zadnjo posodobitev."

msgid "If something went wrong"
msgstr "Če je prišlo do težave"

msgid "If the computer won't start properly"
msgstr "Če se računalnik ne zažene pravilno"

msgid ""
"If the disk is encrypted, its password is typed when the computer starts, "
"before EvenKeelOS loads. Which keyboard layout is used then?"
msgstr ""
"Če je disk šifriran, se njegovo geslo vnese ob zagonu računalnika, še preden "
"se naloži EvenKeelOS. Katera razporeditev tipkovnice se takrat uporablja?"

msgid ""
"If updates are listed, click Update and type your password. Some finish while"
" the computer restarts."
msgstr ""
"Če so posodobitve prikazane, kliknite »Posodobi« in vnesite svoje geslo. "
"Nekatere se dokončajo med ponovnim zagonom računalnika."

msgid ""
"If you type a disk password every time the computer starts, it can unlock by "
"itself with the computer's security chip."
msgstr ""
"Če vsakič ob zagonu računalnika vnesete geslo za disk, se lahko ta samodejno "
"odklene s pomočjo varnostnega čipa računalnika."

msgid ""
"If yours does, download the maker's .rpm file and open it from Downloads. "
"Wheelhouse sees that it's a printer driver."
msgstr ""
"Če je pri vas tako, prenesite proizvajalčevo datoteko .rpm in jo odprite v "
"mapi Prejemi. Wheelhouse prepozna, da gre za gonilnik tiskalnika."

msgid "Important settings deleted"
msgstr "Pomembne nastavitve so bile izbrisane"

msgid ""
"Important system settings are really deleted, and the computer restarts right"
" away. The next start finds them missing, puts them back from the copy it "
"saved, and restarts once more by itself. A message at login then lists what "
"was put back."
msgstr ""
"Pomembne sistemske nastavitve so dejansko izbrisane, računalnik pa se takoj "
"znova zažene. Ob naslednjem zagonu sistem ugotovi, da manjkajo, jih obnovi iz"
" shranjene kopije in se nato samodejno znova zažene. Ob prijavi se prikaže "
"sporočilo, ki našteva, kaj je bilo obnovljeno."

msgid ""
"In a box it updates with System Update; added to the system it never updates."
msgstr ""
"V vsebniku se posodablja z orodjem »Posodobitev sistema«; dodan v sistem se "
"nikoli ne posodobi."

