msgid "Install {name}"
msgstr "Namesti {name}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Install {title}"
msgstr "Namesti {title}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"In a box, these parts of {title} won't work:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"A .deb file can't go on the system. For everything to work, look for {title} as an .rpm file or in Bazaar, the app store.\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: puts it in a box anyway, without those parts."
msgstr ""
"Namesti {title}\n"
"\n"
"V vsebniku ti deli programa {title} ne bodo delovali:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"Datoteke .deb ni mogoče dodati v sistem. Da bo vse delovalo, poiščite {title} kot datoteko .rpm ali v trgovini z aplikacijami Bazaar.\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: ga vseeno postavi v vsebnik, brez teh delov."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"It comes from {maker}'s own download source, which is added to the system so {title} keeps updating. Needs your password and a restart.\n"
"\n"
"To connect, you need a {maker} account."
msgstr ""
"Namesti {title}\n"
"\n"
"Prihaja iz lastnega vira za prenos podjetja {maker}, ki se doda v sistem, da se {title} še naprej posodablja. Potrebna sta vaše geslo in ponovni zagon.\n"
"\n"
"Za povezavo potrebujete račun pri {maker}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Add to the system. In a box, these parts of {title} won't work:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"On the system, everything works. Needs your password and a restart.\n"
"\n"
"Or {setup}: puts it in a separate box. It's easier to remove, but those parts won't work."
msgstr ""
"Namesti {title}\n"
"\n"
"Priporočeno: Dodaj v sistem. V vsebniku ti deli programa {title} ne bodo delovali:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"V sistemu deluje vse. Potrebna sta vaše geslo in ponovni zagon.\n"
"\n"
"Ali pa {setup}: ga postavi v ločen vsebnik. Lažje ga je odstraniti, vendar ti deli ne bodo delovali."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: puts it in a separate box. Your system isn't changed, and Remove Apps takes it out cleanly."
msgstr ""
"Namesti {title}\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: ga postavi v ločen vsebnik. Vaš sistem ostane nespremenjen, »Odstrani aplikacije« pa ga čisto odstrani."

