msgid ""
"It didn't work.\n"
"\n"
"The details are in {log}"
msgstr ""
"Ni delovalo.\n"
"\n"
"Podrobnosti so v {log}"

msgid ""
"It gives anyone at the keyboard a shell with full control, with no password."
msgstr "Vsakomur za tipkovnico da lupino s popolnim nadzorom, brez gesla."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "It goes in the {label} and updates with System Update."
msgstr "Namesti se v {label} in se posodablja z orodjem »Posodobitev sistema«."

msgid "It has no app of its own; other apps in the box use it."
msgstr "Nima lastne aplikacije; uporabljajo jo druge aplikacije v vsebniku."

msgid "It has no window of its own in Show Apps."
msgstr "V »Pokaži programe« nima lastnega okna."

msgid "It is a command-line tool, so it has no window in Show Apps."
msgstr "To je orodje ukazne vrstice, zato v »Pokaži programe« nima okna."

msgid "It is made for a different kind of processor than this computer has."
msgstr "Narejeno je za drugo vrsto procesorja, kot ga ima ta računalnik."

msgid ""
"It may not work yet. When it does, it works in Firefox and the Camera app, "
"not every app."
msgstr ""
"Morda še ne deluje. Ko deluje, deluje v Firefoxu in aplikaciji Kamera, ne pa "
"v vseh aplikacijah."

msgid ""
"It needs parts that the Ubuntu box (Ubuntu 24.04) does not have. It may be "
"made for a newer or older Ubuntu."
msgstr ""
"Potrebuje dele, ki jih vsebnik Ubuntu (Ubuntu 24.04) nima. Morda je narejen "
"za novejši ali starejši Ubuntu."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"It needs {name}, which Fedora {version} does not have. It may be made for a "
"different Fedora version."
msgstr ""
"Potrebuje {name}, česar Fedora {version} nima. Morda je namenjeno drugi "
"različici Fedore."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"It needs {name}, which the Ubuntu box (Ubuntu 24.04) does not have. It may be"
" made for a newer or older Ubuntu."
msgstr ""
"Potrebuje {name}, ki ga vsebnik Ubuntu (Ubuntu 24.04) nima. Morda je narejen "
"za novejši ali starejši Ubuntu."

msgid "It never updates."
msgstr "Nikoli se ne posodobi."

msgid ""
"It opens file sharing ports: folders are shared only on Home networks, in "
"Shared folders."
msgstr ""
"Odpre vrata za skupno rabo datotek: mape so v skupni rabi samo v omrežjih "
"»Dom«, v »Mape v skupni rabi«."

msgid "It says first whether the app keeps itself updated, then installs it."
msgstr "Najprej pove, ali se aplikacija sama posodablja, nato pa jo namesti."

msgid "It starts when you restart the computer."
msgstr "Zažene se, ko znova zaženete računalnik."

msgid ""
"It stops a driver from loading. If it's the drive's or the screen's driver, "
"the computer won't start."
msgstr ""
"Prepreči nalaganje gonilnika. Če gre za gonilnik diska ali zaslona, se "
"računalnik ne bo zagnal."

msgid ""
"It tells you whether there's a version for EvenKeelOS, or a replacement that "
"does the same job."
msgstr ""
"Pove vam, ali obstaja različica za EvenKeelOS ali pa nadomestek, ki opravlja "
"enako nalogo."

msgid ""
"It turns off SELinux, which keeps apps and services from reaching what they "
"shouldn't."
msgstr ""
"Izklopi SELinux, ki preprečuje, da bi aplikacije in storitve dostopale do "
"stvari, do katerih ne bi smele."

msgid "It turns off or weakens a security protection."
msgstr "Izklopi ali oslabi varnostno zaščito."

msgid "It turns off protection against processor security flaws."
msgstr "Izklopi zaščito pred varnostnimi pomanjkljivostmi procesorja."

msgid ""
"It turns off the graphics driver: low resolution, no outside screens, and "
"sleep may not work."
msgstr ""
"Izklopi grafični gonilnik: nizka ločljivost, brez zunanjih zaslonov in način "
"mirovanja morda ne bo deloval."

msgid "It updates by itself."
msgstr "Samodejno se posodablja."

msgid ""
"It would replace a file that belongs to the system, so it was not added."
msgstr "To bi nadomestilo datoteko, ki pripada sistemu, zato ni bila dodana."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "It's already set: the version from {date} starts at your next restart."
msgstr ""
"Že je nastavljeno: različica iz {date} se bo zagnala ob naslednjem ponovnem "
"zagonu."

msgid "It's in Wheelhouse if you want it again."
msgstr "Najdete ga v Wheelhouse, če ga želite znova uporabiti."

msgid "It's on. From your next restart, the disk unlocks by itself."
msgstr ""
"Vklopljeno je. Ob naslednjem ponovnem zagonu se bo disk samodejno odklenil."

msgid ""
"Its file changed or holds more than one certificate, so nothing was removed. "
"Tell your helper."
msgstr ""
"Njegova datoteka se je spremenila ali pa vsebuje več kot eno potrdilo, zato "
"nič ni bilo odstranjeno. Sporočite to svojemu pomočniku."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Its file is removed, but \"{name}\" is still trusted: it was added somewhere "
"else too. Tell your helper."
msgstr ""
"Njegova datoteka je odstranjena, vendar je potrdilo »{name}« še vedno "
"zaupanja vredno: dodano je bilo tudi drugje. Obvestite svojega pomočnika."

