msgstr "Izberite težavo za preizkus. Vaš računalnik bi to moral odpraviti sam."

msgid "Pick a test, click Start the test, and type your password."
msgstr "Izberite preizkus, kliknite »Zaženi preizkus« in vnesite svoje geslo."

msgid "Pick an .exe or .msi to get its Linux version"
msgstr "Izberite datoteko .exe ali .msi, da dobite njeno različico za Linux"

msgid "Pick an .rpm or .deb file from Downloads"
msgstr "Izberite datoteko .rpm ali .deb iz mape Prejemi"

msgid "Pick an app or game so other computers can reach it"
msgstr ""
"Izberite aplikacijo ali igro, da bodo drugi računalniki lahko dostopali do "
"nje"

msgid "Pick it again in Get a VPN."
msgstr "Znova ga izberite v »Pridobi VPN«."

msgid "Pick one."
msgstr "Izberite eno."

msgid "Pick the app for the web, mail, calendar, music, videos and photos."
msgstr ""
"Izberite aplikacijo za splet, e-pošto, koledar, glasbo, videoposnetke in "
"fotografije."

msgid ""
"Pick the app. To use it every time for that kind of file, turn on Always use "
"for this file type first."
msgstr ""
"Izberite aplikacijo. Če jo želite vedno uporabljati za to vrsto datoteke, "
"najprej vklopite možnost »Vedno uporabi za to vrsto datoteke«."

msgid ""
"Pick the box. It's set up again, with its apps. Your files aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Izberite vsebnik. Znova se nastavi, skupaj s svojimi aplikacijami. Vaših "
"datotek se to ne dotakne."

msgid "Pick the day. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Izberite dan. »Nazaj« ga pusti takega, kot je."

msgid ""
"Pick the folder, then how often it changes: every hour, every day or at each "
"login."
msgstr ""
"Izberite mapo, nato pa še, kako pogosto se naj spreminja: vsako uro, vsak dan"
" ali ob vsaki prijavi."

msgid "Pick the fonts for menus, documents and code"
msgstr "Izberite pisave za menije, dokumente in kodo"

msgid "Pick the hour. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Izberite uro. »Nazaj« jo pusti tako, kot je."

msgid "Pick the minute. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Izberite minuto. »Nazaj« jo pusti tako, kot je."

msgid "Pick the month. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Izberite mesec. »Nazaj« ga pusti takega, kot je."

msgid "Pick the place next to a network. It changes at once."
msgstr "Izberite mesto poleg omrežja. Spremeni se takoj."

msgid ""
"Pick the speakers or headphones under Output Device, and the microphone under"
" Input Device."
msgstr ""
"Pod možnostjo »Odvodna naprava« izberite zvočnike ali slušalke, pod možnostjo"
" »Vhodna naprava« pa mikrofon."

msgid "Pick the year. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Izberite leto. »Nazaj« ga pusti tako, kot je."

msgid "Pick what you need. It explains each choice."
msgstr "Izberite, kar potrebujete. Pojasni vsako možnost."

msgid "Pick which ones open when you log in"
msgstr "Izberite, kateri se odprejo ob prijavi"

msgid "Place"
msgstr "Mesto"

msgid ""
"Plug in a USB stick, then click it to save the log on it. Click Refresh if it"
" isn't listed, or Back."
msgstr ""
"Vstavite USB ključ, nato pa kliknite nanj, da nanj shranite dnevnik. Kliknite"
" »Osveži«, če ni na seznamu, ali pa »Nazaj«."

msgid "Plug in a second USB stick, then click Save the results again."
msgstr "Vstavite drugi USB ključ, nato znova kliknite »Shrani rezultate«."

msgid ""
"Plug in a second USB stick, then click it to save the log on it. Or click "
"Back."
msgstr ""
"Vstavite drugi USB ključ, nato ga kliknite, da nanj shranite dnevnik. Ali pa "
"kliknite »Nazaj«."

msgid "Plug it in. It shows in the left side of Files."
msgstr "Priključite ga. Prikaže se na levi strani Datotek."

msgid "Plug the computer in. Open Wheelhouse, Updates, Update firmware."
msgstr ""
"Priključite računalnik na napajanje. Odprite Wheelhouse, Posodobitve, "
"Posodobi vdelano programsko opremo."

msgid ""
"Point your phone's camera at the code. It opens the report on GitHub with the"
" details filled in. To send it, sign in to GitHub, or make a free account if "
"you don't have one. It carries the end of the log; the whole log can go on a "
"USB stick. Click Back when done."
msgstr ""
"Usmerite kamero telefona v kodo. Odpre poročilo na GitHubu z že izpolnjenimi "
"podrobnostmi. Če ga želite poslati, se prijavite v GitHub ali si ustvarite "
"brezplačen račun, če ga še nimate. Vsebuje konec dnevnika; celoten dnevnik "
"lahko shranite na USB ključ. Ko končate, kliknite »Nazaj«."

msgid "Port, like 8080, or a range, like 2456-2458"
msgstr "Vrata, na primer 8080, ali obseg, na primer 2456–2458"

msgid "Power modes"
msgstr "Načini delovanja"

msgid "Prefer the terminal?"
msgstr "Imate raje terminal?"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Preparing the {label}."
msgstr "Pripravlja se {label}."

msgid ""
"Press Print Screen. Pick the whole screen, a window, or drag over an area, "
"then click the round button."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite Print Screen. Izberite celoten zaslon, okno ali pa povlecite po "
"območju, nato pa kliknite okrogli gumb."

msgid "Printers didn't open. Open Settings, then Printers."
msgstr "Tiskalniki se niso odprli. Odprite Nastavitve, nato pa Tiskalniki."

msgid ""
"Printers is open. Choose Add Printer.\n"
"\n"
"If your printer isn't there or doesn't print right, open this file again and choose Install the driver."
msgstr ""
"Tiskalniki so odprti. Izberite »Dodaj tiskalnik«.\n"
"\n"
"Če vašega tiskalnika ni na seznamu ali ne tiska pravilno, znova odprite to datoteko in izberite »Namesti gonilnik«."

msgid ""
"Printers is open. Choose Add Printer.\n"
"\n"
"If your printer isn't there or doesn't print right, open this file again to see how to get the driver."
msgstr ""
"Tiskalniki so odprti. Izberite »Dodaj tiskalnik«.\n"
"\n"
"Če vašega tiskalnika ni na seznamu ali ne tiska pravilno, znova odprite to datoteko, da vidite, kako dobiti gonilnik."

msgid "Printing"
msgstr "Tiskanje"

msgid "Printing doesn't start"
msgstr "Tiskanje se ne začne"

msgid "Printing service off"
msgstr "Storitev tiskanja je izklopljena"

msgid "Problem"
msgstr "Težava"

msgid "Protocol"
msgstr "Protokol"

msgid "Public place"
msgstr "Javni prostor"

msgid ""
"Public place: nothing on the network can reach your computer. Pick it for "
"cafes, hotels and airports."
msgstr ""
"Javni prostor: nič v omrežju ne more doseči vašega računalnika. Izberite to "
"možnost za kavarne, hotele in letališča."

msgid "Put EvenKeelOS on this computer"
msgstr "Namesti EvenKeelOS na ta računalnik"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Put back: {apps}."
msgstr "Vrnjeno: {apps}."

msgid ""
"Put the device in pairing mode. Its instructions say how, often by holding "
"its power button."
msgstr ""
"Preklopite napravo v način za seznanjanje. V navodilih piše, kako to storiti "
"– običajno tako, da pridržite gumb za vklop."

msgid "Put the pictures in one folder, for example in Pictures."
msgstr "Slike premaknite v eno mapo, na primer v mapo »Slike«."

msgid "Quick fixes"
msgstr "Hitri popravki"

msgid "Quick test"
msgstr "Hiter preizkus"

#, python-brace-format
