msgstr "Zapri {app}"

msgid "Quitting %s"
msgstr "Zapiranje %s"

msgid "Read and write"
msgstr "Branje in pisanje"

msgid "Read only"
msgstr "Samo za branje"

msgid "Reading the disk"
msgstr "Branje diska"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Reading the download source {name}"
msgstr "Branje vira prenosa {name}"

msgid "Reading the list of apps from the new download source"
msgstr "Branje seznama aplikacij iz novega vira za prenos"

msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Priporočeno"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Recommended: Delete the box. It frees about {size}, and comes back by itself "
"the next time you install {apps}. Anything added to the box another way is "
"deleted too. Your files are not touched."
msgstr ""
"Priporočeno: Izbriši vsebnik. Sprosti približno {size} in se samodejno vrne, "
"ko naslednjič namestite {apps}. Izbrisano bo tudi vse, kar je bilo v vsebnik "
"dodano na drug način. Vaših datotek se to ne dotakne."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Recommended: Delete the box. It frees its disk space, and comes back by "
"itself the next time you install {apps}. Anything added to the box another "
"way is deleted too. Your files are not touched."
msgstr ""
"Priporočeno: Izbriši vsebnik. Sprosti svoj prostor na disku in se samodejno "
"vrne, ko naslednjič namestite {apps}. Izbrisano bo tudi vse, kar je bilo v "
"vsebnik dodano na drug način. Vaših datotek se to ne dotakne."

msgid ""
"Recommended: Go back now. The computer restarts on the version that worked "
"before. Your files and apps aren't touched. If automatic updates are on, they"
" pause for 3 days, so the same update doesn't come straight back."
msgstr ""
"Priporočeno: Vrni se zdaj. Računalnik se znova zažene v različici, ki je prej"
" delovala. Vaših datotek in aplikacij se to ne dotakne. Če so samodejne "
"posodobitve vklopljene, se za 3 dni začasno ustavijo, da se ista posodobitev "
"ne vrne takoj."

msgid ""
"Recommended: Go back now. The computer restarts with the boot options you had"
" before."
msgstr ""
"Priporočeno: Vrni se zdaj. Računalnik se znova zažene z možnostmi zagona, ki "
"ste jih imeli prej."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Recommended: Install {name}."
msgstr "Priporočeno: Namesti {name}."

msgid "Recommended: Open it."
msgstr "Priporočeno: Odpri."

msgid ""
"Recommended: Restart now to start using it. Or Later, if you're in the middle"
" of something."
msgstr ""
"Priporočeno: Znova zaženi zdaj, da ga začnete uporabljati. Ali pa Pozneje, če"
" ste sredi nečesa."

msgid ""
"Recommended: Restart now. Or Later, if you're in the middle of something."
msgstr "Priporočeno: Znova zaženi zdaj. Ali pa Pozneje, če ste sredi nečesa."

msgid ""
"Recommended: Restart now. The computer restarts and tries once more. If it's "
"still broken, this window asks once more about 3 minutes after you log in, "
"and then it can go back."
msgstr ""
"Priporočeno: Znova zaženi zdaj. Računalnik se znova zažene in poskusi še "
"enkrat. Če je še vedno pokvarjeno, vas to okno približno 3 minute po prijavi "
"vpraša še enkrat, nato se lahko vrne nazaj."

msgid ""
"Recommended: Update. Keep the computer plugged in. Some updates finish while "
"the computer restarts."
msgstr ""
"Priporočeno: Posodobi. Računalnik naj ostane priključen na napajanje. "
"Nekatere posodobitve se dokončajo med ponovnim zagonom računalnika."

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Osveži"

msgid "Reinstall"
msgstr "Ponovno namesti"

