msgstr "Diaprojekcija"

msgid ""
"Some app boxes didn't update.\\n\\nRecommended: Check the boxes. It checks "
"them and repairs one that's broken. Your files aren't touched.\\n\\nOr Not "
"now."
msgstr ""
"Nekateri vsebniki za aplikacije se niso posodobili.\\n\\nPriporočeno: Preveri"
" vsebnike. Preveri jih in popravi pokvarjenega. Vaših datotek se to ne "
"dotakne.\\n\\nAli pa Ne zdaj."

msgid ""
"Some apps from .rpm or .deb files run in an app box. If one stops starting, "
"open Wheelhouse, Apps, Repair app boxes."
msgstr ""
"Nekatere aplikacije iz datotek .rpm ali .deb se izvajajo v vsebniku za "
"aplikacije. Če se katera ne zažene več, odprite Wheelhouse, Aplikacije, "
"Popravi vsebnike za aplikacije."

msgid ""
"Some audio and video formats are covered by patents in some countries.\n"
"Fedora, and this image, leave them out. Installing them is your choice and your\n"
"responsibility."
msgstr ""
"V nekaterih državah so nekateri zvočni in video formati zaščiteni s patenti.\n"
"Fedora in ta slika jih ne vključujeta. Njihova namestitev je vaša odločitev in vaša\n"
"odgovornost."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Some important system settings were broken, and putting them back didn't fix the start, so your computer went back to the version from {since}, which has its own settings. Your files and apps aren't touched, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgstr ""
"Nekatere pomembne sistemske nastavitve so bile pokvarjene in njihova obnovitev ni popravila zagona, zato se je računalnik vrnil na različico iz {since}, ki ima svoje nastavitve. Vaših datotek in aplikacij se to ni dotaknilo, samodejne posodobitve pa niso začasno ustavljene.\n"
"\n"
"Obvestite svojega pomočnika. »Shrani podrobnosti o težavi« v Wheelhouse ustvari datoteko, ki mu jo pošljete."

msgid ""
"Some video formats (like most web video) need extra codecs that Fedora, and "
"this system, leave out because of patents in some countries. Installing them "
"is your choice and your responsibility.\\n\\nWeb video only: lets Firefox "
"play most web video. A small addition to the system.\\n\\nEverything: plays "
"all common video and audio, in every app. It replaces some parts of the "
"system, so system updates take a little longer.\\n\\nNot now: they're in "
"Wheelhouse, Apps, Media codecs, any time.\\n\\nPick by what you need. If you "
"only watch video in Firefox, Web video only is enough."
msgstr ""
"Nekateri video formati (kot je večina spletnega videa) potrebujejo dodatne "
"kodeke, ki jih Fedora in ta sistem ne vključujeta zaradi patentov v nekaterih"
" državah. Njihova namestitev je vaša odločitev in vaša odgovornost.\\n\\nSamo"
" spletni video: Firefoxu omogoči predvajanje večine spletnega videa. Majhen "
"dodatek k sistemu.\\n\\nVse: predvaja ves običajen video in zvok, v vsaki "
"aplikaciji. Zamenja nekatere dele sistema, zato posodobitve sistema trajajo "
"nekoliko dlje.\\n\\nNe zdaj: kadar koli jih najdete v Wheelhouse, Aplikacije,"
" Kodeki za predstavnost.\\n\\nIzberite glede na to, kar potrebujete. Če video"
" gledate samo v Firefoxu, zadostuje »Samo spletni video«."

msgid ""
"Some video formats, like most web video, need media codecs that aren't part of the system. The next window explains the choices.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Next. Or Skip: they're in Wheelhouse, Apps, Media codecs, any time."
msgstr ""
"Nekateri video formati, kot je večina spletnega videa, potrebujejo kodeke za predstavnost, ki niso del sistema. Naslednje okno pojasni možnosti.\n"
"\n"
"Priporočeno: Naprej. Ali pa Preskoči: kadar koli jih najdete v Wheelhouse, Aplikacije, Kodeki za predstavnost."

msgid ""
"Some, like printer drivers, are added to the system: they're ready after the "
"next restart."
msgstr ""
"Nekatere komponente, kot so gonilniki za tiskalnike, se dodajo sistemu: "
"pripravljene bodo po naslednjem ponovnem zagonu."

