msgstr ""
"Slog: Privzeto (svetlo) ali Temno. Barva poudarka: barva gumbov in ikon map."

msgid "Suggested"
msgstr "Predlagano"

msgid ""
"Sunset and sunrise can't be worked out for this time zone. Use Custom times."
msgstr ""
