msgstr "Preizkusi samodejno vrnitev na prejšnje stanje"

msgid "Text size"
msgstr "Velikost besedila"

msgid "That couldn't be saved."
msgstr "Tega ni bilo mogoče shraniti."

msgid "That didn't save. Try again in Wheelhouse, Network safety."
msgstr "To se ni shranilo. Poskusite znova v Wheelhouse, Varnost omrežja."

msgid "That folder belongs to someone else."
msgstr "Ta mapa pripada nekomu drugemu."

msgid "That folder has no pictures in it (JPEG, PNG or WebP)."
msgstr "V tej mapi ni slik (JPEG, PNG ali WebP)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "That folder is already shared, as {name}."
msgstr "Ta mapa je že v skupni rabi kot {name}."

msgid "That folder isn't shared."
msgstr "Ta mapa ni v skupni rabi."

msgid "That folder wasn't found."
msgstr "Te mape ni bilo mogoče najti."

msgid "That folder's name can't be shared. Rename it or pick another."
msgstr ""
"Imena te mape ni mogoče dati v skupno rabo. Preimenujte jo ali izberite "
"drugo."

msgid "That isn't let in here."
msgstr "To tukaj nima dostopa."

msgid "That isn't the disk password, so nothing was changed. Try again."
msgstr "To ni geslo za disk, zato se nič ni spremenilo. Poskusite znova."

msgid ""
"That was the wrong disk password too many times, so it's locked for an hour. "
"Nothing was changed. Try again after that."
msgstr ""
"Prevečkrat ste vnesli napačno geslo za disk, zato je zaklenjen za eno uro. "
"Nič se ni spremenilo. Nato poskusite znova."

msgid ""
"The BIOS screen uses the keyboard. When you're done, choose Save and Exit, or"
" Exit."
msgstr ""
"Na zaslonu BIOS-a se uporablja tipkovnica. Ko končate, izberite Save and Exit"
" (shrani in izstopi) ali Exit (izstopi)."

msgid ""
"The BIOS's RAID setting (Intel RST) hides the disk. Restart into the BIOS and"
" set the storage mode (often called SATA mode or SATA operation) to AHCI. "
"Windows on this disk won't start after that change, but installing EvenKeelOS"
" erases it anyway."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitev RAID v BIOS-u (Intel RST) skrije disk. Znova zaženite računalnik v"
" BIOS in nastavite način shranjevanja (pogosto imenovan način SATA ali "
"delovanje SATA) na AHCI. Sistem Windows na tem disku se po tej spremembi ne "
"bo zagnal, vendar ga bo namestitev EvenKeelOS v vsakem primeru izbrisala."

msgid "The Bluetooth driver is blocked, so there's no Bluetooth."
msgstr "Gonilnik za Bluetooth je blokiran, zato Bluetootha ni."

msgid ""
"The NVIDIA card runs on the open-source driver built into EvenKeelOS. The "
"proprietary NVIDIA driver isn't used: it breaks too often to keep the promise"
" that EvenKeelOS just works. If you need it, use Bazzite or Bluefin's NVIDIA "
"editions instead."
msgstr ""
"Grafična kartica NVIDIA deluje z odprtokodnim gonilnikom, vgrajenim v "
"EvenKeelOS. Lastniški gonilnik NVIDIA se ne uporablja: prepogosto se pokvari,"
" da bi EvenKeelOS lahko držal obljubo, da preprosto deluje. Če ga "
"potrebujete, raje uporabite izdaji NVIDIA sistemov Bazzite ali Bluefin."

msgid "The QR code could not be made. Save the log to a stick instead."
msgstr ""
"QR-kode ni bilo mogoče ustvariti. Namesto tega shranite dnevnik na USB ključ."

msgid "The USB stick could not be opened."
msgstr "USB ključka ni bilo mogoče odpreti."

msgid "The VPN list is missing."
msgstr "Seznam VPN-jev manjka."

msgid "The Wi-Fi card's driver is blocked, so there's no Wi-Fi."
msgstr "Gonilnik kartice Wi-Fi je blokiran, zato Wi-Fi ne deluje."

msgid "The administrator password was not given, so nothing was changed."
msgstr "Skrbniško geslo ni bilo vneseno, zato se ni nič spremenilo."

msgid "The administrator password wasn't given, so nothing was changed."
msgstr "Skrbniškega gesla niste vnesli, zato se ni nič spremenilo."

msgid "The app system (Flatpak)"
msgstr "Sistem aplikacij (Flatpak)"

msgid "The app's instructions say TCP, UDP or both"
msgstr "V navodilih aplikacije piše TCP, UDP ali oboje"

msgid "The automatic rollback test worked."
msgstr "Preizkus samodejne vrnitve je uspel."

msgid ""
"The automatic update is already running, so this window follows it until it's"
" done. You can keep working."
msgstr ""
"Samodejna posodobitev že poteka, zato to okno sledi njenemu poteku, dokler ni"
" končana. Lahko nadaljujete z delom."

msgid ""
"The battery is at %s%% and the computer isn't plugged in. If the battery runs"
" out during the update, the update is lost and has to start "
"again.\\n\\nRecommended: Not now. Plug the computer in, then start System "
"Update again.\\n\\nOr Update anyway."
msgstr ""
"Baterija je na %s%% in računalnik ni priključen na napajanje. Če se baterija "
"med posodobitvijo izprazni, se posodobitev izgubi in jo je treba začeti "
"znova.\\n\\nPriporočeno: Ne zdaj. Priključite računalnik na napajanje, nato "
"znova zaženite »Posodobitev sistema«.\\n\\nAli pa Vseeno posodobi."

msgid ""
"The battery is at %s%%. Plug the computer in: if it runs out during the "
"update, the update is lost."
msgstr ""
"Baterija je na %s%%. Priključite računalnik na napajanje: če se baterija med "
"posodobitvijo izprazni, se posodobitev izgubi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The biggest disk holds {gb} GB."
msgstr "Največji disk ima {gb} GB prostora."

