"Možnosti zagona, s katerimi se računalnik zažene, ni bilo mogoče prebrati."

msgid "The box is missing or broken."
msgstr "Vsebnika ni ali pa je pokvarjen."

msgid ""
"The buttons at a window's top right minimize, maximize and close it, as on "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
"Gumbi v zgornjem desnem kotu okna ga pomanjšajo, povečajo in zaprejo, tako "
"kot v sistemu Windows."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The camera ({device})"
msgstr "Kamera ({device})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The certificate \"{name}\" was added to this computer and has been removed, "
"so it's no longer trusted. If you didn't remove it, tell your helper."
msgstr ""
"Potrdilo »{name}« je bilo dodano v ta računalnik in je bilo odstranjeno, zato"
" ni več zaupanja vredno. Če ga niste odstranili vi, obvestite svojega "
"pomočnika."

msgid "The certificates couldn't be checked."
msgstr "Potrdil ni bilo mogoče preveriti."

msgid "The change was not made, and nothing was left behind."
msgstr "Sprememba ni bila izvedena in nič ni ostalo za sabo."

msgid "The check couldn't finish."
msgstr "Preverjanja ni bilo mogoče dokončati."

msgid "The clock and time zone settings could not be saved."
msgstr "Nastavitev ure in časovnega pasu ni bilo mogoče shraniti."

msgid ""
"The codecs are installed. They start working after a restart, which the setup"
" checklist offers at its end."
msgstr ""
"Kodeki so nameščeni. Začnejo delovati po ponovnem zagonu, ki ga kontrolni "
"seznam za nastavitev predlaga na koncu."

msgid ""
"The codecs are installed.\\n\\nRecommended: Restart now to start using them. "
"Or Later."
msgstr ""
"Kodeki so nameščeni.\\n\\nPriporočeno: Znova zaženi zdaj, da jih začnete "
"uporabljati. Ali pa Pozneje."

msgid "The codecs are removed. Restart to finish."
msgstr "Kodeki so odstranjeni. Za dokončanje znova zaženite računalnik."

msgid "The codecs weren't removed."
msgstr "Kodeki niso bili odstranjeni."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The computer didn't start properly with the boot options changed in "
"Wheelhouse, so it went back to the version from {since}, with the boot "
"options it had before."
msgstr ""
"Računalnik se ni pravilno zagnal z možnostmi zagona, spremenjenimi v "
"Wheelhouse, zato se je vrnil na različico iz {since} s prejšnjimi možnostmi "
"zagona."

msgid ""
"The computer hasn't saved a copy of its settings since this start yet. Wait a"
" few minutes and try again. If it keeps saying this, tell your helper: the "
"copy isn't being saved."
msgstr ""
"Računalnik od tega zagona še ni shranil kopije svojih nastavitev. Počakajte "
"nekaj minut in poskusite znova. Če se to sporočilo še naprej prikazuje, "
"povejte svojemu pomočniku: kopija se ne shranjuje."

msgid "The computer locks up"
msgstr "Računalnik zamrzne"

msgid ""
"The computer may not start, or may lose its drive, memory or processors."
msgstr ""
"Računalnik se morda ne bo zagnal ali pa bo izgubil pogon, pomnilnik ali "
"procesorje."

msgid ""
"The computer restarts and opens its BIOS settings screen. Save your work first.\n"
"\n"
"The BIOS settings are used with the keyboard. When you're done, choose Save and Exit, or Exit, to start the computer again."
msgstr ""
"Računalnik se znova zažene in odpre zaslon z nastavitvami BIOS-a. Najprej shranite svoje delo.\n"
"\n"
"Nastavitve BIOS-a se upravljajo s tipkovnico. Ko končate, izberite Save and Exit (shrani in izstopi) ali Exit (izstopi), da računalnik znova zaženete."

msgid ""
"The computer restarts, fails on purpose, then goes back by itself. A note at "
"login says the test worked and what the test copy found broken."
msgstr ""
"Računalnik se znova zažene, namerno odpove, nato pa se samodejno vrne nazaj. "
"Opomba ob prijavi sporoči, da je preizkus uspel, in kaj je testna kopija "
"odkrila kot pokvarjeno."

msgid "The computer starts with the usual settings."
msgstr "Računalnik se zažene z običajnimi nastavitvami."

msgid ""
"The computer would start without the desktop: a text screen or a rescue "
"shell."
msgstr ""
"Računalnik bi se zagnal brez namizja: prikazal bi se besedilni zaslon ali "
"reševalna lupina."

msgid "The desktop"
msgstr "Namizje"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The device rule wasn't added, so the device may not work.\n"
"\n"
"{details}"
msgstr ""
"Pravilo za napravo ni bilo dodano, zato naprava morda ne bo delovala.\n"
"\n"
"{details}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The device rule wasn't added, so the device may not work.\n"
"{details}"
msgstr ""
"Pravilo za napravo ni bilo dodano, zato naprava morda ne bo delovala.\n"
"{details}"

msgid "The disk is full. Free some space, then try again."
msgstr "Disk je poln. Sprostite nekaj prostora, nato pa poskusite znova."

msgid "The disk is hidden by a BIOS setting."
msgstr "Disk je skrit zaradi nastavitve v BIOS-u."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The disk {disk} was not found, or can't be written to."
msgstr "Diska {disk} ni bilo mogoče najti ali pa nanj ni mogoče zapisovati."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The download source stays. Open {filename} again to pick an app, or remove it"
" in Wheelhouse, Apps, Remove apps."
msgstr ""
"Vir prenosa ostane. Ponovno odprite {filename}, da izberete aplikacijo, ali "
"pa jo odstranite v Wheelhouse, Aplikacije, Odstrani aplikacije."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The download source was added, but it has no apps to show right now. Check "
"your internet connection, then open {filename} again."
msgstr ""
"Vir za prenos je bil dodan, vendar trenutno nima nobenih aplikacij za prikaz."
" Preverite svojo internetno povezavo, nato pa znova odprite {filename}."

msgid ""
"The earlier version doesn't have the settings repair yet, so if the repair "
"didn't work, going back to it would give a wrong message. Run the test after "
"the next update."
msgstr ""
"Prejšnja različica še nima popravila nastavitev, zato bi v primeru, da "
"popravilo ni delovalo, vrnitev nanjo prikazala napačno sporočilo. Po "
"naslednji posodobitvi zaženite preizkus."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The file could not be written: {error}."
msgstr "Datoteke ni bilo mogoče zapisati: {error}."

msgid "The fingerprint reader"
msgstr "Bralnik prstnih odtisov"

msgid "The firewall"
msgstr "Požarni zid"

msgid "The firewall didn't reload."
msgstr "Požarni zid se ni ponovno naložil."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The firewall didn't take the change: {reason}"
msgstr "Požarni zid ni sprejel spremembe: {reason}"

msgid "The firewall doesn't start"
msgstr "Požarni zid se ne zažene"

msgid ""
"The firewall fails to start, so during the test the computer has no firewall."
msgstr ""
"Požarni zid se ne zažene, zato med preizkusom računalnik nima požarnega zidu."

msgid "The firewall isn't answering"
msgstr "Požarni zid se ne odziva"

msgid "The firmware update didn't finish. Try again later."
msgstr ""
"Posodobitev vdelane programske opreme ni bila dokončana. Poskusite znova "
"pozneje."

msgid "The firmware updater"
msgstr "Posodabljevalnik vdelane programske opreme"

msgid ""
"The first meeting asks whether to install Chrome or use your usual browser."
msgstr ""
"Ob prvem sestanku vas vpraša, ali naj namesti Chrome ali uporabi vaš običajni"
" brskalnik."

msgid ""
"The first time, choose Install Chrome or Use the usual browser. The meeting "
"opens in Zoom's web version."
msgstr ""
"Prvič izberite »Namesti Chrome« ali »Uporabi običajni brskalnik«. Sestanek se"
" odpre v spletni različici Zooma."

msgid "The full codecs are already installed. Restart if you have not yet."
msgstr "Polni kodeki so že nameščeni. Če še niste, znova zaženite računalnik."

msgid "The full guide"
msgstr "Celoten vodnik"

msgid "The full name is empty."
msgstr "Polno ime je prazno."

msgid ""
"The graphics driver is blocked, so the screen runs in a basic mode: it may "
"look blurry or slow, or stay black (then just wait)."
msgstr ""
"Gonilnik grafične kartice je blokiran, zato zaslon deluje v osnovnem načinu: "
"slika je lahko zamegljena ali počasna oziroma zaslon ostane črn (v tem "
"primeru preprosto počakajte)."

msgid "The install could not be finished."
msgstr "Namestitve ni bilo mogoče dokončati."

msgid "The install stopped"
msgstr "Namestitev se je ustavila"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The installer could not start: {error}"
msgstr "Namestitvenega programa ni bilo mogoče zagnati: {error}"

msgid "The installer couldn't open. Use Install EvenKeelOS in the dock."
msgstr ""
"Namestitvenega programa ni bilo mogoče odpreti. Uporabite »Namesti "
"EvenKeelOS« v vrstici z aplikacijami."

msgid "The installer stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "Namestitveni program se je nepričakovano ustavil."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The keyboard ({device})"
msgstr "Tipkovnica ({device})"

msgid "The last lines of the log:"
msgstr "Zadnje vrstice dnevnika:"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The last start failed its start-up checks, and some system settings were missing or replaced. Your computer put back {n} from the copy it saved {saved}, then restarted. Your files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"If it happens again, tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgid_plural ""
"The last start failed its start-up checks, and some system settings were missing or replaced. Your computer put back {n} from the copy it saved {saved}, then restarted. Your files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"If it happens again, tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
