"Zadnji zagon ni prestal preverjanj ob zagonu, nekatere sistemske nastavitve pa so manjkale ali bile zamenjane. Računalnik je obnovil {n} nastavitev iz kopije, ki jo je shranil {saved}, nato se je znova zagnal. Vaših datotek in aplikacij se to ni dotaknilo.\n"
"\n"
"Obnovljeno: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"Če se to ponovi, obvestite svojega pomočnika. »Shrani podrobnosti o težavi« v Wheelhouse ustvari datoteko, ki mu jo pošljete."

msgid "The layout didn't change."
msgstr "Postavitev se ni spremenila."

msgid ""
"The layout, colors, wallpaper, dark at night, fonts, screen size, night "
"light, sound and accounts"
msgstr ""
"Postavitev, barve, ozadje, temno ponoči, pisave, velikost zaslona, nočna "
"osvetlitev, zvok in računi"

msgid "The login screen doesn't start"
msgstr "Prijavni zaslon se ne zažene"

msgid ""
"The login screen fails to start, so you never see it. The computer restarts "
"by itself within seconds, twice, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Prijavni zaslon se ne zažene, zato ga nikoli ne vidite. Računalnik se "
"samodejno znova zažene v nekaj sekundah, dvakrat, in pri tretjem zagonu se "
"vrne na to različico."

msgid ""
"The login screen works, but logging in drops you back to it. Log in a second "
"time; after the second drop the computer restarts by itself. Do that on 2 "
"starts, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Prijavni zaslon deluje, vendar vas prijava vrne nanj. Prijavite se še enkrat;"
" po drugi vrnitvi se računalnik samodejno znova zažene. To naredite pri dveh "
"zagonih, ob tretjem zagonu pa se vrne na to različico."

msgid "The media codecs start working after a restart."
msgstr "Kodeki za predstavnost začnejo delovati po ponovnem zagonu."

msgid ""
"The menu that opens has Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, the sound volume, the screen "
"brightness, the power mode, dark style and night light."
msgstr ""
"Meni, ki se odpre, vsebuje Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, glasnost zvoka, svetlost "
"zaslona, način delovanja, temno temo in nočno osvetlitev."

msgid "The new files could not be labelled."
msgstr "Novih datotek ni bilo mogoče označiti."

msgid "The new partitions did not show up."
msgstr "Nove particije se niso prikazale."

msgid "The new system could not be set to take signed updates."
msgstr ""
"Novega sistema ni bilo mogoče nastaviti tako, da bi sprejemal podpisane "
"posodobitve."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The new system has no {name} group."
msgstr "V novem sistemu ni skupine {name}."

msgid "The new system's desktop layouts could not be found."
msgstr "Postavitev namizja v novem sistemu ni bilo mogoče najti."

msgid "The new system's settings database could not be found."
msgstr "Zbirke podatkov z nastavitvami novega sistema ni bilo mogoče najti."

msgid "The next network you join starts as a Public place."
msgstr "Naslednje omrežje, s katerim se povežete, se začne kot Javni prostor."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The next start uses: {settings}"
msgstr "Ob naslednjem zagonu bo uporabljeno: {settings}"

msgid "The one-time setup window is already closed."
msgstr "Okno za enkratno nastavitev je že zaprto."

msgid "The password is typed and matches."
msgstr "Geslo je vneseno in se ujema."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The password wasn't saved: {reason}"
msgstr "Geslo ni bilo shranjeno: {reason}"

msgid ""
"The picture is copied, ready to paste, and saved in Pictures, Screenshots."
msgstr ""
"Slika je kopirana, pripravljena za lepljenje in shranjena v mapi Slike, "
"Zaslonske slike."

msgid ""
"The power button in that menu has Suspend, Restart, Power Off and Log Out."
msgstr ""
"Gumb za vklop/izklop v tem meniju ponuja možnosti V pripravljenost, Ponovno "
"zaženi, Izklopi in Odjava."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The printer driver {title} is ready."
msgstr "Gonilnik tiskalnika {title} je pripravljen."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The printer driver {title} is ready.\n"
"\n"
"Open Printers: choose Add Printer, then your printer."
msgstr ""
"Gonilnik tiskalnika {title} je pripravljen.\n"
"\n"
"Odprite Tiskalnike: izberite »Dodaj tiskalnik«, nato svoj tiskalnik."

msgid "The printing service fails to start."
msgstr "Storitev tiskanja se ne zažene."

msgid "The restart didn't start"
msgstr "Ponovni zagon se ni začel"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The restart said:\n"
"\n"
"{message}\n"
"\n"
"Exit code: {code}"
msgstr ""
"Ob ponovnem zagonu je bilo prikazano naslednje sporočilo:\n"
"\n"
"{message}\n"
"\n"
"Izstopna koda: {code}"

msgid ""
"The root account is the system's own administrator. Most people never need "
"it: your own account can be an administrator instead."
msgstr ""
"Korenski račun je sistemski skrbnik. Večina ljudi tega sploh ne potrebuje: "
"namesto tega je lahko skrbnik vaš lastni račun."

msgid "The root password could not be set."
msgstr "Korenskega gesla ni bilo mogoče nastaviti."

msgid "The screen flashes white, often with an outside display"
msgstr "Zaslon utripa belo, pogosto skupaj z zunanjim zaslonom"

msgid ""
"The settings are deleted, but the computer didn't restart. Restart it now: "
"the next start puts them back."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitve so izbrisane, vendar se računalnik ni znova zagnal. Znova ga "
"zaženite zdaj: naslednji zagon jih obnovi."

msgid "The settings repair test didn't work."
msgstr "Preizkus popravila nastavitev ni uspel."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The settings repair test didn't work: your computer couldn't put the deleted settings back, so it went back to the version from {since}, which has its own settings. Your files and apps aren't touched, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgstr ""
"Preizkus popravila nastavitev ni uspel: računalnik ni mogel obnoviti izbrisanih nastavitev, zato se je vrnil na različico iz {since}, ki ima svoje nastavitve. Vaših datotek in aplikacij se to ni dotaknilo, samodejne posodobitve pa niso začasno ustavljene.\n"
"\n"
"Obvestite svojega pomočnika. »Shrani podrobnosti o težavi« v Wheelhouse ustvari datoteko, ki mu jo pošljete."

msgid "The settings repair test worked."
msgstr "Preizkus popravila nastavitev je uspel."

msgid "The sound chip's driver is blocked, so there's no sound."
msgstr "Gonilnik zvočnega čipa je blokiran, zato ni zvoka."

msgid ""
"The start menu, windows, the menu at the end of the bar, notifications, "
"screenshots and shortcuts"
msgstr ""
"Začetni meni, okna, meni na koncu vrstice, obvestila, posnetki zaslona in "
"bližnjice"

msgid "The sun doesn't set or rise here today, so it's dark until it rises."
msgstr ""
"Sonce danes tukaj ne zaide niti ne vzide, zato je temno, dokler ne vzide."

msgid "The sun doesn't set or rise here today, so it's light until it sets."
msgstr ""
"Sonce danes tukaj ne zaide niti ne vzide, zato je svetlo, dokler ne zaide."

msgid "The system core crashed (a protection fault)"
msgstr "Jedro sistema se je zrušilo (napaka pri zaščiti)"

msgid "The system core crashed (an oops)"
msgstr "Jedro sistema se je zrušilo (oops)"

msgid "The system core reported a bug"
msgstr "Jedro sistema je sporočilo napako"

msgid ""
"The system itself can't be changed by apps or by mistake. Each update "
"replaces it whole."
msgstr ""
"Samega sistema ne morejo spremeniti ne aplikacije ne pomota. Vsaka "
"posodobitev ga v celoti zamenja."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The test copy ({name}) is ready. It starts at your next restart."
msgstr ""
"Testna kopija ({name}) je pripravljena. Zažene se ob naslednjem ponovnem "
"zagonu."

msgid ""
"The test marker is removed. The version without it starts at your next "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"Označba za preizkus je odstranjena. Različica brez nje se zažene ob "
"naslednjem ponovnem zagonu."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The test worked. At the next start your computer found important settings missing, put back {n} setting from the copy it saved {saved}, and restarted by itself.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}."
msgid_plural ""
"The test worked. At the next start your computer found important settings missing, put back {n} settings from the copy it saved {saved}, and restarted by itself.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}."
msgstr[0] ""
"Preizkus je uspel. Ob naslednjem zagonu je računalnik ugotovil, da manjkajo pomembne nastavitve, obnovil {n} nastavitev iz kopije, ki jo je shranil {saved}, in se samodejno znova zagnal.\n"
"\n"
"Obnovljeno: {what}."
msgstr[1] ""
"Preizkus je uspel. Ob naslednjem zagonu je računalnik ugotovil, da manjkajo pomembne nastavitve, obnovil {n} nastavitvi iz kopije, ki jo je shranil {saved}, in se samodejno znova zagnal.\n"
"\n"
"Obnovljeno: {what}."
msgstr[2] ""
"Preizkus je uspel. Ob naslednjem zagonu je računalnik ugotovil, da manjkajo pomembne nastavitve, obnovil {n} nastavitve iz kopije, ki jo je shranil {saved}, in se samodejno znova zagnal.\n"
"\n"
"Obnovljeno: {what}."
msgstr[3] ""
"Preizkus je uspel. Ob naslednjem zagonu je računalnik ugotovil, da manjkajo pomembne nastavitve, obnovil {n} nastavitev iz kopije, ki jo je shranil {saved}, in se samodejno znova zagnal.\n"
"\n"
"Obnovljeno: {what}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The test worked. Your computer went back by itself to the version from "
"{since}, and the test copy is removed."
msgstr ""
"Preizkus je uspel. Računalnik se je samodejno vrnil na različico iz {since}, "
"testna kopija pa je odstranjena."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The touchpad ({device})"
msgstr "Sledilna ploščica ({device})"

msgid "The two don't match yet."
msgstr "Gesli se še ne ujemata."

msgid "The update did not finish. Details: journalctl -u %s"
msgstr "Posodobitev se ni zaključila. Podrobnosti: journalctl -u %s"

msgid "The update didn't finish."
msgstr "Posodobitev ni bila dokončana."

msgid ""
"The update didn't finish. Nothing is broken: your computer keeps running the "
"version it has.\\n\\nTry again later."
msgstr ""
"Posodobitev se ni zaključila. Nič ni pokvarjeno: vaš računalnik še naprej "
"uporablja različico, ki jo ima nameščeno.\\n\\nPoskusite znova pozneje."

msgid "The update program"
msgstr "Program za posodobitve"

msgid ""
"The update program is swapped for one that always fails (until the next "
"restart; nothing on the disk changes)."
msgstr ""
"Program za posodobitve je zamenjan s programom, ki vedno spodleti (do "
"naslednjega ponovnega zagona; na disku se nič ne spremeni)."

msgid "The user name is empty."
msgstr "Uporabniško ime je prazno."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The version you're using now is from {current}. The one from before it, from {older}, is still on this computer.\n"
"\n"
"If something stopped working after the last update: Undo the update. The version from {older} starts at your next restart. Your files and your apps aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Različica, ki jo uporabljate zdaj, je iz {current}. Različica pred njo, iz {older}, je še vedno v tem računalniku.\n"
"\n"
"Če je po zadnji posodobitvi kaj prenehalo delovati: Razveljavi posodobitev. Različica iz {older} se zažene ob naslednjem ponovnem zagonu. Vaših datotek in aplikacij se to ne dotakne."

msgid ""
"The version you're using now is the one before it with boot options changed in Wheelhouse.\n"
"\n"
"Undo the change: the computer starts with the boot options it had before, at your next restart. Automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Or Cancel."
msgstr ""
"Trenutno uporabljate prejšnjo različico z možnostmi zagona, ki so bile spremenjene v Wheelhouse.\n"
"\n"
"Razveljavi spremembo: računalnik se ob naslednjem ponovnem zagonu zažene z možnostmi zagona, ki jih je imel prej. Samodejne posodobitve niso začasno ustavljene.\n"
"\n"
"Ali pa Prekliči."

msgid "The wallpaper changes to the next picture in a folder of yours."
msgstr "Ozadje se spremeni v naslednjo sliko v eni od vaših map."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The {fs} file system could not be loaded, so the disk can't be prepared."
msgstr ""
"Datotečnega sistema {fs} ni bilo mogoče naložiti, zato diska ni mogoče "
"pripraviti."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is deleted."
msgstr "{label} je izbrisan."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is not working."
msgstr "{label} ne deluje."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is repaired."
msgstr "{label} je popravljen."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The {label} isn't working.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Repair the box. It rebuilds the box, puts your apps back, then installs {title}. Your files aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"{label} ne deluje.\n"
"\n"
"Priporočeno: Popravi vsebnik. Znova zgradi vsebnik, vrne vaše aplikacije in nato namesti {title}. Vaših datotek se to ne dotakne."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} ({unit})"
msgstr "{name} ({unit})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} graphics drive the screen."
msgstr "Grafika {name} poganja zaslon."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} service ({unit})"
msgstr "Storitev {name} ({unit})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {title} download isn't signed by ArtCraft, so it was not installed."
msgstr "Prenosa {title} ni podpisal ArtCraft, zato ni bil nameščen."

msgid "There are no app boxes to repair."
msgstr "Ni vsebnikov za aplikacije, ki bi jih bilo treba popraviti."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "There is no start-up keyboard layout for {layout}."
msgstr "Za {layout} ni razporeditve tipkovnice za zagon."

msgid ""
"There's no earlier version on this computer to go back to. Only the version "
"you're using now is kept."
msgstr ""
"Na tem računalniku ni starejše različice, na katero bi se lahko vrnili. "
"Obdržana je samo različica, ki jo trenutno uporabljate."

msgid ""
"There's no earlier version to fall back to if putting the settings back "
"doesn't work, so the test doesn't run. Try it after the next update."
msgstr ""
"Če obnovitev nastavitev ne uspe, ni na voljo starejše različice, na katero bi"
" se lahko vrnili, zato se preizkus ne izvede. Poskusite po naslednji "
"posodobitvi."

msgid "These security certificates need attention. Pick one to see what to do."
msgstr ""
"Ta varnostna potrdila potrebujejo pozornost. Izberite enega, da vidite, kaj "
"storiti."

msgid "They open in Chrome."
msgstr "Odprejo se v Chromu."

msgid "They open in your usual browser. Choose to be asked about Chrome again."
msgstr ""
"Odprejo se v vašem običajnem brskalniku. Izberite, naj vas glede Chroma "
"vpraša znova."

msgid "This account can't share folders."
msgstr "Ta račun ne more dati map v skupno rabo."

msgid ""
"This computer asks for the disk password every time it starts. The computer's security chip can unlock the disk instead.\n"
"\n"
"This needs the disk password, so it's one for your helper.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Set it up. Or Skip: it's in Wheelhouse any time."
msgstr ""
"Ta računalnik ob vsakem zagonu zahteva geslo za disk. Namesto tega lahko disk odklene varnostni čip računalnika.\n"
"\n"
"Za to je potrebno geslo za disk, zato je to naloga za vašega pomočnika.\n"
"\n"
"Priporočeno: Nastavi. Ali pa Preskoči: kadar koli je na voljo v Wheelhouse."

msgid ""
"This computer can't go back by itself: it was installed before automatic "
"rollback was added, or automatic rollback was switched off. Computers "
"installed from a newer USB have it."
msgstr ""
"Ta računalnik se ne more sam vrniti nazaj: nameščen je bil, preden je bila "
"dodana samodejna vrnitev, ali pa je bila samodejna vrnitev izklopljena. "
"Računalniki, nameščeni z novejšega USB ključa, jo imajo."

msgid ""
"This computer can't open its BIOS settings from here. Press the BIOS key "
"while it starts (often F2, F10, F12 or Delete)."
msgstr ""
"Ta računalnik tukaj ne more odpreti svojih nastavitev BIOS-a. Med zagonom "
"pritisnite tipko za BIOS (pogosto F2, F10, F12 ali Delete)."

msgid ""
"This computer has no security chip (TPM) that can do this, so the disk "
"password stays."
msgstr ""
"Ta računalnik nima varnostnega čipa (TPM), ki bi to lahko opravil, zato geslo"
" za disk ostane."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This computer is running a test copy ({name}) as its normal version, so a new test can't start from it.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Remove the test marker. The version without it starts at your next restart. Needs your password."
msgstr ""
"Ta računalnik uporablja testno kopijo ({name}) kot svojo običajno različico, zato z nje ni mogoče začeti novega preizkusa.\n"
"\n"
"Priporočeno: Odstrani označbo za preizkus. Različica brez nje se zažene ob naslednjem ponovnem zagonu. Potrebno je vaše geslo."

msgid ""
"This computer is running a test copy. Open Test automatic rollback again to "
"remove its marker."
msgstr ""
"Ta računalnik uporablja testno kopijo. Znova odprite »Preizkusi samodejno "
"vrnitev na prejšnje stanje«, da odstranite njeno označbo."

msgid "This computer started the USB stick in old BIOS (legacy) mode."
msgstr "Ta računalnik je zagnal USB ključ v starem načinu BIOS (legacy)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This desktop uses {now}.\n"
"\n"
"Switch to {new}? It takes effect after you log out and back in.\n"
"\n"
"Or Keep it."
msgstr ""
"To namizje uporablja {now}.\n"
"\n"
"Želite preklopiti na {new}? Sprememba začne veljati, ko se odjavite in znova prijavite.\n"
"\n"
"Ali pa Obdrži."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This file can't be installed. It may be damaged or not fully downloaded. Download it again and retry.\n"
"\n"
"(Details: {details})"
msgstr ""
"Te datoteke ni mogoče namestiti. Morda je poškodovana ali ni bila v celoti prenesena. Prenesite jo znova in poskusite še enkrat.\n"
"\n"
"(Podrobnosti: {details})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This file is an older version of {title} than the one you have.\n"
"\n"
"Install the older version: replaces yours. Only do this if the newer one has a problem."
msgstr ""
"Ta datoteka je starejša različica programa {title} od tiste, ki jo imate.\n"
"\n"
"Namesti starejšo različico: zamenja vašo. To storite samo, če ima novejša različica težavo."

msgid ""
"This is a live session: it runs from the USB stick, nothing here is saved, "
"and the computer's disk isn't touched."
msgstr ""
"To je seja v živo: deluje z USB ključka, nič od tega se ne shrani in disk "
"računalnika ostane nedotaknjen."

msgid ""
"This is how the computer shows up on your network. Keep the suggestion, or "
"type a new one."
msgstr ""
"Tako je računalnik prikazan v vašem omrežju. Obdržite predlog ali vnesite "
"novega."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This is the 32-bit version of {title}, for older computers. Download the "
"64-bit version instead (often called amd64 or x86_64)."
msgstr ""
"To je 32-bitna različica programa {title}, namenjena starejšim računalnikom. "
"Namesto tega prenesite 64-bitno različico (pogosto imenovano amd64 ali "
"x86_64)."

msgid "This network"
msgstr "To omrežje"

msgid ""
"This removes things the computer no longer needs: unused app parts, old "
"system update files, and unused container images. Your files and your apps "
"aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"S tem se odstranijo stvari, ki jih računalnik ne potrebuje več: neuporabljeni"
" deli aplikacij, stare datoteke posodobitev sistema in neuporabljene slike "
"vsebnikov. Vaše datoteke in aplikacije ostanejo nedotaknjene."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This saves the computer's recent error messages, its system version and the list of your apps to one file, {name}, in your Documents folder. What your apps showed or opened isn't in it.\n"
"\n"
"Then email that file to your helper. They can see what went wrong without being here.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing is sent anywhere by itself."
msgstr ""
"To shrani nedavna sporočila o napakah računalnika, njegovo različico sistema in seznam vaših aplikacij v eno datoteko, {name}, v mapi Dokumenti. Tega, kar so vaše aplikacije prikazale ali odprle, ni v njej.\n"
"\n"
"Nato to datoteko po e-pošti pošljite svojemu pomočniku. Tako lahko vidi, kaj je šlo narobe, ne da bi bil tukaj.\n"
"\n"
"Nič se ne pošlje nikamor samo od sebe."

msgid ""
"This sets what other devices on this network can reach. Pick Public place "
"anywhere you're not sure. You can change it later in Wheelhouse, Network "
"safety."
msgstr ""
"To določa, do česa lahko dostopajo druge naprave v tem omrežju. Kjer koli "
"niste prepričani, izberite »Javni prostor«. To lahko pozneje spremenite v "
"Wheelhouse, Varnost omrežja."

msgid ""
"This sets what you see at first. The next step suggests a desktop layout to "
"match, and the guide is in Wheelhouse, Get help, either way."
msgstr ""
"To določa, kaj boste najprej videli. V naslednjem koraku je predlagana "
"ujemajoča se postavitev namizja, vodnik pa je v Wheelhouse, Poišči pomoč – v "
"vsakem primeru."

msgid "This setting is risky"
msgstr "Ta nastavitev je tvegana"

msgid "This start found these broken, as the test expects:"
msgstr "Ta zagon je našel te stvari pokvarjene, kot preizkus pričakuje:"

msgid "This start found these still broken, as the test expects:"
msgstr ""
"Ta zagon je našel te stvari še vedno pokvarjene, kot preizkus pričakuje:"

msgid "This system's EFI partition: %s (disk %s, partition %s)"
msgstr "Particija EFI tega sistema: %s (disk %s, particija %s)"

msgid "This takes a while."
msgstr "To bo trajalo nekaj časa."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "This version is from {when}."
msgstr "Ta različica je iz {when}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This {title} file is for a different kind of computer. Download the version "
"for this one (often called {names})."
msgstr ""
"Ta datoteka {title} je namenjena drugi vrsti računalnika. Prenesite različico"
" za ta računalnik (pogosto imenovano {names})."

msgid ""
"Those are file sharing ports: folders are shared only on Home networks, in "
"Shared folders."
msgstr ""
"To so vrata za skupno rabo datotek: mape so v skupni rabi samo v omrežjih "
"»Dom«, v »Mape v skupni rabi«."

msgid "Thunderbolt or USB4 ports"
msgstr "Vrata Thunderbolt ali USB4"

msgid "Time server name"
msgstr "Ime časovnega strežnika"

msgid "Time servers"
msgstr "Časovni strežniki"

msgid ""
"Time servers to use instead of Fedora's. Type a name and click Add. Click a "
"server to take it off. Click Back when done."
msgstr ""
"Časovni strežniki, ki naj se uporabljajo namesto Fedorinih. Vnesite ime in "
"kliknite »Dodaj«. Kliknite strežnik, da ga odstranite. Ko končate, kliknite "
"»Nazaj«."

msgid "Time zone"
msgstr "Časovni pas"

msgid "To be asked again: Wheelhouse, Apps, Zoom meetings."
msgstr "Za ponovno vprašanje: Wheelhouse, Aplikacije, Sestanki v Zoomu."

msgid "To change your password, click Password."
msgstr "Če želite spremeniti geslo, kliknite »Geslo«."

msgid "To check that this works on your computer, see Getting help."
msgstr ""
"Če želite preveriti, ali to deluje na vašem računalniku, glejte razdelek "
"»Pridobivanje pomoči«."

msgid "To choose which apps can notify you: Settings, Notifications."
msgstr ""
"Če želite izbrati, katere aplikacije vam lahko pošiljajo obvestila: "
"Nastavitve, Obvestila."

msgid "To free the space for good: open Trash and click Empty."
msgstr "Za trajno sprostitev prostora: odprite Smeti in kliknite »Izprazni«."

msgid ""
"To get it back: open Trash in the left side of Files, right-click the file, "
"and choose Restore From Trash."
msgstr ""
"Za obnovitev: na levi strani Datotek odprite Smeti, z desno tipko miške "
"kliknite datoteko in izberite »Obnovi iz smeti«."

msgid ""
"To give someone their own account, click Add User. Leave Administrator off "
"for children and guests."
msgstr ""
"Če želite nekomu dodeliti lasten račun, kliknite »Dodaj uporabnika«. Za "
"otroke in goste pustite možnost »Skrbnik« izklopljeno."

msgid "To go on, click Erase and install. To pick another disk, click Back."
msgstr ""
"Za nadaljevanje kliknite »Izbriši in namesti«. Za izbiro drugega diska "
"kliknite »Nazaj«."

msgid ""
"To make one: select the files, right-click, choose Compress, give it a name, "
"and click Create."
msgstr ""
"Če ga želite ustvariti: izberite datoteke, kliknite z desno tipko miške, "
"izberite »Stisni«, vnesite ime in kliknite »Ustvari«."

msgid ""
"To open one: right-click it and choose Extract. The files go in a folder next"
" to it."
msgstr ""
"Za odpiranje: z desno tipko miške ga kliknite in izberite »Odpakiraj«. "
"Datoteke gredo v mapo poleg njega."

msgid "To print, press Ctrl+P in any app."
msgstr "Za tiskanje pritisnite Ctrl+P v katerikoli aplikaciji."

msgid ""
"To record a video instead, click the video camera icon in the same tool "
"before you start. Recordings go to Videos, Screencasts."
msgstr ""
"Če želite namesto tega posneti video, pred začetkom v istem orodju kliknite "
"ikono videokamere. Posnetki se shranijo v Video, Zaslonski posnetek."

msgid "To update now: open Wheelhouse, Updates, System Update."
msgstr ""
"Če želite posodobiti zdaj: odprite Wheelhouse, Posodobitve, Posodobitev "
"sistema."

msgid ""
"Told to add a setting by a helper? Type it under Your own settings. Risky "
"ones are explained first."
msgstr ""
"Vam je pomočnik naročil, da dodate nastavitev? Vnesite jo pod »Vaše lastne "
"nastavitve«. Tvegane so najprej pojasnjene."

msgid "Too weak"
msgstr "Preslabo"

msgid "Tool"
msgstr "Orodje"

msgid "Top bar, apps from the bottom dock"
msgstr "Zgornja vrstica, aplikacije iz spodnje vrstice z aplikacijami"

msgid "Touchpad"
msgstr "Sledilna ploščica"

msgid "Touchpad found."
msgstr "Zaznana je sledilna ploščica."

msgid ""
"Try again in a minute. If this stays, use Save problem details in Get help."
msgstr ""
"Poskusite znova čez minuto. Če težava ostane, v »Poišči pomoč« uporabite "
"»Shrani podrobnosti o težavi«."

msgid "Try again later."
msgstr "Poskusite znova pozneje."

msgid "Try anyway"
msgstr "Vseeno poskusi"

msgid "Try it first"
msgstr "Najprej preizkusi"

msgid "Turn automatic updates off or on"
msgstr "Izklopi ali vklopi samodejne posodobitve"

msgid "Turn it on"
msgstr "Vklopi"

msgid ""
"Turn it on below, and computers on your Home network can open the folders you"
" pick."
msgstr ""
"Vklopite jo spodaj in računalniki v omrežju »Dom« lahko odpirajo mape, ki jih"
" izberete."

msgid "Turn it on from a Home network."
msgstr "Vklopite jo v omrežju »Dom«."

msgid "Turn off"
msgstr "Izklopi"

msgid "Turn on"
msgstr "Vklopi"

msgid "Turn on anyway"
msgstr "Vseeno vklopi"

msgid ""
"Turn on automatic updates or automatic disk unlock, or free up disk space"
msgstr ""
"Vklopite samodejne posodobitve ali samodejno odklepanje diska ali pa "
"sprostite prostor na disku"

msgid ""
"Turn sharing off and on again. If this stays, use Save problem details in Get"
" help."
msgstr ""
"Izklopite skupno rabo in jo znova vklopite. Če težava ostane, v »Poišči "
"pomoč« uporabite »Shrani podrobnosti o težavi«."

msgid ""
"Turn the printer on. Plug it in with its cable, or join it to the same Wi-Fi."
msgstr ""
"Vklopite tiskalnik. Priključite ga s kablom ali pa ga povežite z istim "
"omrežjem Wi-Fi."

msgid "Turn them on or off"
msgstr "Vklopi jih ali izklopi"

msgid "Turning automatic updates back on."
msgstr "Ponovno vklapljanje samodejnih posodobitev."

msgid "Turning off automatic disk unlock."
msgstr "Izklop samodejnega odklepanja diska."

msgid "Turning off automatic updates."
msgstr "Izklop samodejnih posodobitev."

msgid "Turning on automatic disk unlock."
msgstr "Vklop samodejnega odklepanja diska."

msgid "Turning on automatic updates."
msgstr "Vklop samodejnih posodobitev."

msgid "Turns off Panel Self Refresh"
msgstr "Izklopi Panel Self Refresh"

msgid "Turns off Panel Self Refresh and Panel Replay"
msgstr "Izklopi Panel Self Refresh in Panel Replay"

msgid "Turns off adaptive backlight"
msgstr "Izklopi prilagodljivo osvetlitev zaslona"

msgid "Two choices:"
msgstr "Dve možnosti:"

msgid "Type a setting first."
msgstr "Najprej vnesite nastavitev."

msgid "Type it again"
msgstr "Vnesite ga znova"

msgid "Type it, then type it again below."
msgstr "Vnesite ga, nato pa ga spodaj vnesite še enkrat."

msgid "Type the disk password (the one you type when the computer starts):"
msgstr "Vnesite geslo za disk (tisto, ki ga vnesete ob zagonu računalnika):"

msgid "Type the disk password twice."
msgstr "Dvakrat vnesite geslo za disk."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Type the password for {network}, then click Connect. Back goes to the list."
msgstr ""
"Vnesite geslo za {network}, nato pa kliknite »Poveži«. Gumb »Nazaj« vas vrne "
"na seznam."

msgid "Type the password twice."
msgstr "Vnesite geslo dvakrat."

msgid ""
"Type your full name. Your user name is made from it; type over it to change "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Vnesite svoje polno ime. Iz njega se ustvari vaše uporabniško ime; če ga "
"želite spremeniti, ga prepišite."

msgid "Type your password, then restart. The fix starts at the restart."
msgstr ""
"Vnesite geslo, nato znova zaženite računalnik. Popravek začne veljati ob "
"ponovnem zagonu."

msgid "USB drives and memory cards"
msgstr "Pogoni USB in pomnilniške kartice"

msgid "USB or Bluetooth headphones may still work."
msgstr "Slušalke USB ali Bluetooth morda še vedno delujejo."

msgid "USB stick"
msgstr "USB ključ"

msgid "Ubuntu box"
msgstr "Vsebnik Ubuntu"

msgid "Undo it. See Updates and safety."
msgstr "Razveljavite jo. Glejte »Posodobitve in varnost«."

msgid "Undo the change"
msgstr "Razveljavi spremembo"

msgid "Undo the last update"
msgstr "Razveljavi zadnjo posodobitev"

msgid "Undo the last update in Wheelhouse can still take you back later."
msgstr ""
"»Razveljavi zadnjo posodobitev« v Wheelhouse vas lahko pozneje še vedno vrne "
"nazaj."

msgid "Undo the update"
msgstr "Razveljavi posodobitev"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "Neznano"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Unknown desktop layout {layout}."
msgstr "Neznana postavitev namizja {layout}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Unknown experience {experience}."
msgstr "Neznano izhodišče {experience}."

msgid "Unknown option: %s. Run  codecs  to see the choices."
msgstr "Neznana možnost: %s. Za prikaz možnosti zaženite  codecs ."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Unknown time zone {timezone}."
msgstr "Neznan časovni pas {timezone}."

msgid "Unlock disk automatically"
msgstr "Samodejno odklepanje diska"

msgid ""
"Unlock disk automatically is off. From your next start, the computer asks for"
" the disk password again."
msgstr ""
"Samodejno odklepanje diska je izklopljeno. Od naslednjega zagona naprej "
"računalnik znova zahteva geslo za disk."

msgid ""
"Unlock disk automatically is on. After some firmware updates, the computer "
"asks for the disk password once. Then turn Unlock disk automatically on again"
" in Wheelhouse."
msgstr ""
"Samodejno odklepanje diska je vklopljeno. Po nekaterih posodobitvah vdelane "
"programske opreme računalnik enkrat zahteva geslo za disk. Nato v Wheelhouse "
"znova vklopite »Samodejno odklepanje diska«."

msgid ""
"Unlock disk automatically is on: the disk unlocks by itself when the computer starts.\n"
"\n"
"Turn off: you type the disk password at every start again."
msgstr ""
"Samodejno odklepanje diska je vklopljeno: disk se ob zagonu računalnika odklene sam.\n"
"\n"
"Izklopi: ob vsakem zagonu boste znova vnašali geslo za disk."

msgid "Unplug the device and plug it back in so it works."
msgstr "Odklopite napravo in jo nato ponovno priklopite, da bo delovala."

msgid "Unsigned kernel drivers could load."
msgstr "Nepodpisani gonilniki jedra se lahko naložijo."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Up to {max} settings, each name once."
msgstr "Do {max} nastavitev, vsako ime enkrat."

msgid "Update"
msgstr "Posodobi"

msgid "Update anyway"
msgstr "Vseeno posodobi"

msgid "Update firmware"
msgstr "Posodobi vdelano programsko opremo"

msgid "Update now"
msgstr "Posodobi zdaj"

msgid "Update program broken"
msgstr "Program za posodobitve ne deluje"

msgid "Update the system, apps, app boxes and Homebrew now"
msgstr "Zdaj posodobi sistem, aplikacije, vsebnike za aplikacije in Homebrew"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Update {title} to the newer version in this file?"
msgstr "Želite posodobiti {title} na novejšo različico v tej datoteki?"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Update {title} to the newer version in this file?\n"
"\n"
"Needs your password and a restart."
msgstr ""
"Želite posodobiti {title} na novejšo različico v tej datoteki?\n"
"\n"
"Potrebna sta vaše geslo in ponovni zagon."

msgid "Updated, except: %s"
msgstr "Posodobljeno, razen: %s"

msgid "Updates"
msgstr "Posodobitve"

msgid "Updates and safety"
msgstr "Posodobitve in varnost"

msgid "Updates can't run"
msgstr "Posodobitev ni mogoče izvesti"

msgid "Updates for the computer's own parts, like the BIOS"
msgstr "Posodobitve za lastne dele računalnika, kot je BIOS"

msgid "Updates happen on their own"
msgstr "Posodobitve se izvedejo samodejno"

msgid ""
"Updates install on their own. If one stops the computer starting properly, it"
" goes back to the version before by itself and tells you."
msgstr ""
"Posodobitve se namestijo same. Če se zaradi katere računalnik ne zažene "
"pravilno, se sam vrne na prejšnjo različico in vam to sporoči."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Updates: automatic, from {maker}'s own download source. A daily check finds "
"new versions, which start at the next restart."
msgstr ""
"Posodobitve: samodejne, iz lastnega vira za prenos podjetja {maker}. Dnevno "
"preverjanje najde nove različice, ki se zaženejo ob naslednjem ponovnem "
"zagonu."

msgid "Updates: automatic, with System Update."
msgstr "Posodobitve: samodejne, z orodjem »Posodobitev sistema«."

msgid "Updates: automatic."
msgstr "Posodobitve: samodejne."

msgid ""
"Updates: none, because it came from a file. To update, install a newer file. "
