msgid "Welcome to EvenKeelOS"
msgstr "Dobrodošli v EvenKeelOS"

msgid ""
"Welcome. A few things to set up, one at a time.\n"
"\n"
"1. Media codecs, for web video\n"
"2. Skip the disk password at startup\n"
"3. How to get apps\n"
"\n"
"Each can be skipped.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Start. Or Later: this opens again at the next login. Or Don't show again: it's in Wheelhouse any time."
msgstr ""
"Dobrodošli. Nastaviti je treba nekaj stvari, eno za drugo.\n"
"\n"
"1. Kodeki za predstavnost, za spletni video\n"
"2. Preskoči geslo za disk ob zagonu\n"
"3. Kako pridobiti aplikacije\n"
"\n"
"Vsako lahko preskočite.\n"
"\n"
"Priporočeno: Začni. Ali pa Pozneje: to se znova odpre ob naslednji prijavi. Ali pa Ne prikaži več: kadar koli je na voljo v Wheelhouse."

