#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"This really deletes these files from this computer: the user accounts and passwords (/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/group, /etc/gshadow), the list of disks (/etc/fstab), the login rules (/etc/pam.d) and the administrator rules (/etc/sudoers). Your own files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Save your work and close your apps first: the computer restarts as soon as they're deleted.\n"
"\n"
"If putting them back doesn't work: when a start hangs or stays broken, hold the power button until the computer turns off, then turn it on. After 2 bad starts, the next start is the earlier version kept for Undo the last update, which has its own copy of these settings."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"To zares izbriše te datoteke iz tega računalnika: uporabniške račune in gesla (/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/group, /etc/gshadow), seznam diskov (/etc/fstab), pravila za prijavo (/etc/pam.d) in pravila za skrbnike (/etc/sudoers). Vaših lastnih datotek in aplikacij se to ne dotakne.\n"
"\n"
"Najprej shranite svoje delo in zaprite aplikacije: računalnik se znova zažene takoj, ko so izbrisane.\n"
"\n"
"Če jih ne uspe obnoviti: ko zagon obstane ali ostane pokvarjen, držite gumb za vklop, dokler se računalnik ne izklopi, nato ga vklopite. Po 2 slabih zagonih je naslednji zagon starejša različica, shranjena za »Razveljavi zadnjo posodobitev«, ki ima svojo kopijo teh nastavitev."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"When it comes back, a message says the test worked, and the test copy is removed. Don't turn the computer off during the test unless the steps say to. {save}\n"
"\n"
"The test copy takes the place of the earlier version kept for Undo the last update, so Undo has nothing to go back to until the next update."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"Ko se vrne, sporočilo pove, da je preizkus uspel, testna kopija pa je odstranjena. Med preizkusom ne izklapljajte računalnika, razen če koraki tako navajajo. {save}\n"
"\n"
"Testna kopija zasede mesto prejšnje različice, shranjene za »Razveljavi zadnjo posodobitev«, zato se »Razveljavi« do naslednje posodobitve nima na kaj vrniti."

